{"type":"message","id":"78c653d5","parentId":"85de0729","timestamp":"2026-03-26T00:44:03.216Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Got the weather for Chengdu. Let me present it to the user.","thinkingSignature":"6f308ec619a58e94b1199b63f049aa6eaa6b0fd1ead852c18d21e493acc60726"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n成都今天天气：**多云 ⛅ 14°C**（体感 15°C）\n\n- 湿度：82%\n- 风速：→4km/h\n- 降水：0mm\n\n今天应该不会下雨，出门OK！不过湿度有点高，空气可能有点潮～\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2061,"output":80,"cacheRead":29582,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31723,"cost":{"input":0.0006183,"output":0.000096,"cacheRead":0.00177492,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00248922}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774485839107,"responseId":"0613b45057b0c52c3ab6fbe4405dfa12"}}
