{"type":"message","id":"dfab3c57","parentId":"483ab280","timestamp":"2026-03-26T00:45:44.532Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-26 08:45:43 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b537c55bff4a0c346e99e0b42c04]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b537c55bff4a0c346e99e0b42c04\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-26 08:45 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n帮我推荐一下openclaw的最新开脑洞的玩法。"}],"timestamp":1774485944529}}
{"type":"message","id":"5ea1ffe1","parentId":"dfab3c57","timestamp":"2026-03-26T00:45:54.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to recommend some creative/new ways to use OpenClaw. Let me think about what would be interesting/useful that might not be obvious to everyone.\n\nI should give some creative and fun suggestions for how to use OpenClaw in unexpected ways.","thinkingSignature":"482d97cc44c70a23941ea257f448339cff4b45633544c0ee40ff93282b409d06"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n来点开脑洞的玩法 😏\n\n**🔥 真正骚操作**\n\n1. **AI 第二大脑**\n   把你的笔记、项目文档全部丢给我，问我问题、做总结、找关联。比你自己在文档里翻快多了。\n\n2. **自动化路由器**\n   设个 cron 定时任务，比如每天早上 8 点查天气 + 日历，汇总发给你。起床就知道今天要干啥。\n\n3. **飞书控**\n   直接用自然语言让我帮你创日程、查任务、管多维表格。不用动手点点了。\n\n4. **网页 watchdog**\n   定时抓某个网页，有变化就通知你。比如抢票、蹲商品降价。\n\n5. **文件处理器**\n   帮你批量重命名、整理下载文件夹、写脚本跑自动化。\n\n6. **代码小弟**\n   丢给我一段代码，帮你 review、解释、甚至直接写。\n\n7. **联网搜索员**\n   不知道啥事？让我搜，整理好结论给你，比你自己搜省时间。\n\n---\n\n你有啥具体需求，说个方向我帮你落地 🚀\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108,"output":285,"cacheRead":31620,"cacheWrite":486,"totalTokens":32499,"cost":{"input":0.0000324,"output":0.00034199999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0018972,"cacheWrite":0.00018225,"total":0.00245385}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774485944534,"responseId":"0613b4b9b6e413d76944cd1f0d9f75cf"}}
