{"type":"message","id":"489a67e4","parentId":"ec50a4b8","timestamp":"2026-03-26T00:47:18.795Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is questioning whether these are just theoretical ideas I came up with, or if there are actual concrete examples/cases. Let me be honest - these are ideas I've suggested based on my knowledge of OpenClaw's capabilities. I should clarify this honestly.","thinkingSignature":"85821f09107dd052071af7e68c97a4f54d5b79ad64806871c820e1b1e8a3fa57"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n说实话——这些都是基于 OpenClaw 现有功能想的\"理论上可行\"的方向，不是某个用户真的这么做过的案例 😅\n\n不过你可以去这两个地方找真实玩法：\n\n1. **ClawHub** → https://clawhub.com\n   大家分享的 Skill 和工作流，看看别人在用 OpenClaw 干什么\n\n2. **Discord 社区** → https://discord.com/invite/clawd\n   里面有很多用户在分享自己的用法和技巧\n\n或者——你有什么具体想解决的问题？跟我说说，我来帮你想怎么用 OpenClaw 落地，比泛泛而谈实在多了 😎\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108,"output":188,"cacheRead":31890,"cacheWrite":716,"totalTokens":32902,"cost":{"input":0.0000324,"output":0.00022559999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0019133999999999998,"cacheWrite":0.0002685,"total":0.0024398999999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774486027745,"responseId":"0613b50cb9195a9b5e7135e486832ca6"}}
