{"type":"message","id":"dddaa530","parentId":"44925b21","timestamp":"2026-03-26T00:49:28.636Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to create an example myself. I need to:\n1. Create a new bitable app (or use an existing one)\n2. Create a table with an attachment field\n3. Upload an image as an attachment to a record\n\nLet me first check what bitables exist in the user's account, then create a demo.\n\nActually, let me just create a complete example flow:\n1. Create a new bitable app\n2. Create a table with fields including an attachment field\n3. Add a record with an image attachment\n\nI should use the feishu_bitable tools to do this. Let me start by creating a bitable app.","thinkingSignature":"7915bbbd0098a575bf3ed88fd49b7284c16ac189ac9347abc8d9b6251735201f"},{"type":"text","text":"行！我自己建一个演示给你看流程 👇\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2vere7ffmcjx_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app","arguments":{"action":"create","name":"🍎 苹果虾演示表"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108,"output":194,"cacheRead":32799,"cacheWrite":573,"totalTokens":33674,"cost":{"input":0.0000324,"output":0.0002328,"cacheRead":0.0019679399999999996,"cacheWrite":0.000214875,"total":0.0024480149999999996}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774486163064,"responseId":"0613b5946835a0c6e037a6a8955f2668"}}
