{"type":"message","id":"95c7cdab","parentId":"8a005df9","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:00:16.820Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems the auth isn't being recognized. It might be that the message_id from the auth-complete event is tied to a different session or the auth state isn't being persisted properly. \n\nActually, I think the issue here is that the feishu plugin's OAuth implementation requires the user to click the authorization link in the Feishu card. The \"auth-complete\" events might not be triggering the right way.\n\nLet me try a different approach - since the user seems frustrated with the repeated auth cards, let me explain the limitation and offer an alternative: I can create a record with a text field showing the image URL instead of uploading as an attachment. Or I can just describe what the full flow would be and let the user handle the upload part manually.\n \nI'm going to step back and explain to the user what's actually happening here - the OAuth flow is getting stuck in a loop because the authorization state isn't being properly maintained between calls. I'll offer them a simpler path forward where they handle the upload directly.","thinkingSignature":"931dfac526ae19e60e9749750f472769468de72e3ba493bbbb5f89bb9c42fadf"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n还是没过去这个授权关 😔 看起来 `drive:file:upload` 这个权限的授权流程有点问题，一直在循环。\n\n**换个方案——我来演示完整流程，但图片上传那步得你自己操作：**\n\n---\n\n**✅ 完整流程是这样：**\n\n1. **创建多维表格**（已搞定 ✅）\n   → app_token: `BeRBbpyd9a2eYusZbb1c7N4cn1f`\n\n2. **创建数据表 + 附件字段**（已搞定 ✅）\n   → table_id: `tbl3oA2By4N3FTPh`\n   → 字段：`名称`（文本）、`图片附件`（附件类型）\n\n3. **上传图片到云盘**（卡在这里 ❌）\n   → 需要 `drive:file:upload` 权限，点授权卡也没生效\n\n4. **写入记录附上 file_token**（理论上可以 ✅）\n   → 把上传后的 file_token 写入 `图片附件` 字段\n\n---\n\n**你现在可以手动做第3步：**\n打开这个链接上传图片：\n`https://tcnorh11898l.feishu.cn/base/BeRBbpyd9a2eYusZbb1c7N4cn1f`\n\n上传完把 file_token 发我，我帮你写入记录 📝\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"inpu