{"type":"message","id":"161bcb42","parentId":"95c7cdab","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:00:18.578Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-26 09:00:17 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b537c73cc84b0c320d386b711edb]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b537c73cc84b0c320d386b711edb\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-26 08:54 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n？"}],"timestamp":1774486818574}}
{"type":"message","id":"fe93bf7f","parentId":"161bcb42","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:00:26.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent \"？\" again. They might be confused about what to do next. Let me try a different approach - maybe I can use the feishu_doc_media tool to insert an image into a doc, or maybe there's another way to handle this.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The issue is that drive:file:upload requires OAuth and the authorization flow keeps looping. \n\nWait - maybe I can try a different approach. Instead of uploading to drive first and then attaching to bitable, what if I use the bitable record creation with an external URL approach? Let me think...\n\nActually, looking at the feishu_bitable_app_table_record create API - for attachment fields (type 17), the value should be an array of file tokens. But to get a file token, I need to upload to drive first.\n\n\nI could try uploading directly to the bitable record instead, but the API seems to require a file_token for attachments. The authorization issue might be the real blocker here - perhaps I should walk the user through the OpenClaw troubleshooting steps to see if that resolves the looping authorization problem.","thinkingSignature":"625a7732266478cff24d9108f8ad3f9ae61dae9bdd3a7cc2a5cfbfdaa1c252d5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ofo3xdbc40vd_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-troubleshoot/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108,"output":277,"cacheRead":38179,"cacheWrite":908,"totalTokens":39472,"cost":{"input":0.0000324,"output":0.0003324,"cacheRead":0.00229074,"cacheWrite":0.0003405,"total":0.0029960399999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774486818581,"responseId":"0613b8238a1e04a9535843585647c03b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"595be8c1","parentId":"fe93bf7f","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:00:26.828Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ofo3xdbc40vd_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-troubleshoot\ndescription: |\n  飞书插件问题排查工具。包含常见问题 FAQ 和深度诊断命令（/feishu_doctor）。\n\n  常见问题可随时查阅。诊断命令用于排查复杂问题（多次授权仍失败、自动授权无法解决等），\n  会检查账户配置、API 连通性、应用权限、用户授权状态，并生成详细的诊断报告和解决方案。\n\n---\n\n# 飞书插件问题排查\n\n## ❓ 常见问题（FAQ）\n\n### 卡片按钮点击无反应\n\n**现象**：点击卡片按钮后没有任何反应，然后提示报错.\n\n**原因**：应用未开通「消息卡片回传交互」权限。\n\n**解决步骤**：\n\n1. 登录飞书开放平台：https://open.feishu.cn/app\n2. 选择您的应用 → **事件与回调**\n3. 在回调配置中,修改订阅方式为\"长链接\"并添加回调 \"卡片回传交互\"(card.action.trigger)\n4. 创建应用版本 → 提交审核 → 发布\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 诊断命令（深度工具）\n\n**注意**：诊断命令仅用于排查复杂/疑难的**权限相关问题**。常规权限问题会自动触发授权流程，无需手动诊断。\n\n**何时使用诊断**：\n- 多次授权后仍然报错\n- 自动授权流程无法解决的问题\n- 需要查看完整的权限配置状态\n\n**使用方法**：\n\n在飞书聊天会话中直接输入（作为用户消息发送）：\n\n/feishu doctor\n\n诊断命令会检查：\n\n- **📋 诊断摘要**（首先展示）：\n  - 总体状态（✅ 正常 / ⚠️ 警告 / ❌ 失败）\n  - 发现的问题列表和简要描述\n\n- **环境信息**：\n  - 插件版本\n\n- **账号信息**：\n  - 凭证完整性（appId, appSecret 掩码）\n  - 账户启用状态\n  - API 连通性测试\n  - Bot 信息（名称和 openId）\n\n- **应用身份权限**：\n  - 应用已开通的必需权限数量\n  - 缺失的必需权限列表\n  - 一键申请链接（自动带上缺失权限参数）\n\n- **用户身份权限**：\n  - 用户授权状态统计（✓ 有效 / ⟳ 需刷新 / ✗ 已过期）\n  - Token 自动刷新状态（是否包含 offline_access）\n  - 权限对照表（应用已开通 vs 用户已授权，逐项对比）\n  - 应用权限缺失时的申请指引和链接\n  - 用户授权不足时的重新授权操作方法\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774486826822}}
{"type":"message","id":"91329399","parentId":"595be8c1","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:00:30.438Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me suggest the user run `/feishu doctor` to diagnose the authorization issue. This might help identify why the drive:file:upload authorization keeps failing.","thinkingSignature":"3006abad1a422a07141f32bf89b1e5985e83448615061bb056a26a9a6490a5f2"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n试一下排查命令看看授权到底卡在哪：\n\n**在飞书聊天里输入 `/feishu doctor`**\n\n会帮你诊断权限问题，看看 `drive:file:upload` 为什么一直授权不过 😅\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10440,"output":86,"cacheRead":29582,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40108,"cost":{"input":0.003132,"output":0.0001032,"cacheRead":0.00177492,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00501012}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774486826829,"responseId":"0613b82b24cb039b56bbf0d0bc2bd308"}}
