{"type":"message","id":"18769d52","parentId":"63e828f5","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:09:01.443Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error is `WrongRequestBody`. This means the request body format is wrong. Let me check the correct format for file_token in attachment field.\n\nLooking at the skill docs, it says:\n- 附件：[{file_token: 'xxx'}]\n\nBut maybe the file_token needs to be the actual file token returned from the upload, not the filename. Let me check what was returned from upload:\n```\n{\"success\":true,\"file_token\":\"demo_weather.png\",\"file_name\":\"demo_weather.png\",\"size\":52567}\n```\n\nThe file_token is \"demo_weather.png\" which is odd - it's the original filename, not a real token. That might be the issue. Actually looking more carefully at the upload result, it says success but the file_token is \"demo_weather.png\" - this might just be the filename returned, not an actual Feishu file token. This might be a limitation of the upload tool - maybe it doesn't return a real Feishu file_token.\n \nThe record creation is failing with WrongRequestBody, which suggests the attachment field structure itself might be incorrect. I should verify whether the field type is actually configured for attachments and if the file_token format matches what the API expects - Feishu might require a proper token rather than just the filename. 我需要验证文件是否真的上传成功了。虽然返回了file_token，但如果它实际上只是返回了原文件名而不是真实的飞书文件token，那写入附件字段就会失败。我应该检查drive工具的响应格式，或者直接尝试写入一条不含附件的记录来确认table_id是否正确。","thinkingSignature":"6f3f3691fd4241cace207dca08acd43cf279996b471e5dbeb48685455d82e6e8"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mmjr0y8bn80f_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"BeRBbpyd9a2eYusZbb1c7N4cn1f","table_id":"tbl3oA2By4N3FTPh","fields":{"名称":"成都天气图"}}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12916,"output":420,"cacheRead":29582,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":4291