{"type":"message","id":"6e3fc172","parentId":"2416fafa","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:10:10.228Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Again needing authorization for `base:record:retrieve`. The batch auth says all 20 permissions are granted but individual API calls keep needing authorization. This is a persistent issue.\n\nThe user sent \"?\" which likely means they're confused about what's happening. Let me explain the situation clearly.","thinkingSignature":"140b5284f474d121b14c834f75ed57c6c434e86e8a6ca6b2c199b89bbb0e8b4b"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n每调用一个 API 都要重新点授权卡...这就是飞书插件的现状 😅\n\n**简单说：**\n- 批量授权 = 20个权限都\"理论上\"有了\n- 但每次 API 调用，系统还会单独检查一次，要求再点卡\n\n这是个已知的体验问题——权限和实际调用之间有断层。\n\n**你要不要直接去飞书看表格？**\n👉 https://tcnorh11898l.feishu.cn/base/BeRBbpyd9a2eYusZbb1c7N4cn1f\n\n点开看看「成都天气图」那条记录在不在就行～\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14850,"output":195,"cacheRead":29582,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44627,"cost":{"input":0.004455,"output":0.000234,"cacheRead":0.00177492,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00646392}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774487402662,"responseId":"0613ba6b5bf6bd45bd70dfd457b5c7fe"}}
