{"type":"message","id":"134fd0f6","parentId":"8faf0e14","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:11:54.750Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user says they don't see where the image attachment is. They can see the record but not the attachment field. This confirms that the attachment field (图片附件) didn't get the file uploaded properly. The record was created with just the \"名称\" field but the \"图片附件\" field is empty.\n\nThe issue is that:\n1. We successfully created the record with just \"名称\": \"成都天气图\"\n2. We failed to upload the attachment because the file_token returned from drive:file:upload was \"demo_weather.png\" (original filename) not a proper Feishu file token\n\nSo the user is right - there's no attachment. The attachment field is empty.\n\n\nI should walk them through how the attachment field should work and clarify that the upload process didn't complete properly due to the file_token issue.","thinkingSignature":"5e8e683f37de7a85a09a0737e8a9acfe219b83a12df97b48c64e3ade7af10678"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n对，因为**图片附件写入失败了** 😅\n\n刚才那条记录只有「名称」字段有值，「图片附件」字段是空的。\n\n**原因：**\n`drive:file:upload` 上传后返回的 token 是 `demo_weather.png`（原文件名），不是飞书要求的 `file_xxx` 格式，所以附件字段写入失败。\n\n**正常流程应该是这样的：**\n1. `drive:file:upload` → 返回 `{file_token: \"file_xxxxxx\"}`\n2. 把 `file_xxxxxx` 填进附件字段 → 成功 ✅\n\n但现在第1步返回的 token 格式不对，导致第2步失败。\n\n**解决方案：**\n你可以手动试试：在多维表格里直接点「图片附件」那个字段，手动上传一张图片，看看能不能成功。如果手动可以但API不行，说明是插件的 file_token 转换逻辑有问题。\n\n你要不要试试手动上传看看？\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108,"output":365,"cacheRead":44358,"cacheWrite":343,"totalTokens":45174,"cost":{"input":0.0000324,"output":0.00043799999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00266148,"cacheWrite":0.000128625,"total":0.003260505}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774487503962,"responseId":"0613bad1e3b9224d51de4a7ba6f82164"}}
{"type":"message","id":"879c9fb1","parentId":"134fd0f6","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:12:15.905Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/MRCDä½_ç_å_MRDIMMå_å_æ_ä---d491cf56-636b-4b34-a998-bdd6f751ca95.png (image/png) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/MRCDä½_ç_å_MRDIMMå_å_æ_ä---d491cf56-636b-4b34-a998-bdd6f751ca95.png]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-26 09:12:14 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b537c30bc48b0c1422ab78552226, file, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b537c30bc48b0c1422ab78552226\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-26 09:12 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n[File: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/MRCDä½_ç_å_MRDIMMå_å_æ_ä---d491cf56-636b-4b34-a998-bdd6f751ca95.png]"}],"timestamp":1774487535901}}
{"type":"message","id":"a57b422a","parentId":"879c9fb1","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:12:24.049Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent an image file. Let me check what this image is - it seems to be a screenshot showing the table with \"成都天气图\" record visible, but the 图片附件 field appears empty. Let me analyze the image to see what it shows.\n\nThe file path is: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/MRCDä½_ç_å_MRDIMMå_å_æ_ä---d491cf56-636b-4b34-a998-bdd6f751ca95.png\n\nLet me analyze this image to see what the user is showing me.","thinkingSignature":"c3469c9d5b7648d1682cb8fa5937683567021c9226675d38b744671cc633395b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0dt6bqx6fwpe_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"描述这张图片的内容，特别是飞书多维表格的内容，有没有图片附件，字段显示什么","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/MRCDä½_ç_å_MRDIMMå_å_æ_ä---d491cf56-636b-4b34-a998-bdd6f751ca95.png"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":88,"output":226,"cacheRead":13071,"cacheWrite":25293,"totalTokens":38678,"cost":{"input":0.000026399999999999998,"output":0.0002712,"cacheRead":0.00078426,"cacheWrite":0.009484875,"total":0.010566735}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774487535910,"responseId":"0613baf1534025ebebf8471705f48f18"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d879637d","parentId":"a57b422a","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:13:28.892Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0dt6bqx6fwpe_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片是一张技术原理图解，标题为**“MRCD 如何提升 DDR5 内存带宽”**。它通过对比传统 RDIMM 与新型 MCRDIMM 的架构，详细解释了 MRCD（Multi-Rank Clock Driver）提升带宽的原理。\n\n关于你提到的**“飞书多维表格”**部分：\n**这张图片本身并不是飞书多维表格的界面，也没有包含多维表格的字段或附件。** 它是一张完整的、经过设计的信息图。如果这张图出现在飞书多维表格中，它很可能是作为某个记录的“附件”或“图片”字段上传进去的内容。\n\n以下是对图片内容的详细描述：\n\n### 1. 左右架构对比\n\n*   **左侧：标准 RDIMM (与 RCD)**\n    *   **组件：** 显示了一个 DDR5 RDIMM 内存条，核心组件是 **RCD**。\n    *   **原理：** RCD 进行 **1:1 数据映射**。\n    *   **速率：** DRAM 颗粒速率（例如 4400 MT/s）直接对应逻辑带宽（4400 MT/s）传输给 CPU。\n    *   **结论：** 逻辑带宽 = DRAM 速率。\n\n*   **右侧：MCRDIMM (与 MRCD + MDB)**\n    *   **组件：** 显示了一个 MCRDIMM 内存条，核心组件包含 **MRCD** 和 **MDB** (Multiplexed Data Buffer)。\n    *   **原理：** 内存条上有两个 Rank（Rank 0 和 Rank 1）。MRCD 实现了 **2:1 的物理/逻辑映射**。通过 MRCD 多路复用和 MDB 的组合，将两个 Rank 的带宽并发合并。\n    *   **速率：** 虽然单个颗粒速率仍为 4400 MT/s，但由于是双 Rank 并发工作，传输给 CPU 的逻辑带宽翻倍，达到了 **8800 MT/s**。\n    *   **结论：** 逻辑带宽 = DRAM 速率 x 2。\n\n### 2. 中间对比框\n图片中间用蓝框总结了核心差异：\n*   **标准 RDIMM** -> 逻辑带宽 = DRAM 速率 (Normal speed)。\n*   **VS.**\n*   **MCRDIMM (用 MRCD)** -> 逻辑带宽 = DRAM 速率 x 2 (High speed)。\n\n### 3. 底部总结结论\n图片底部的文字总结了核心技术逻辑：\n**结论：** MRCD 并不是通过使用更高频率的颗粒，而是通过**“时间复用”架构创新**，让标准的、频率较低的颗粒（如 4400 MT/s）能够并发工作，从而实现对 CPU 看到的逻辑带宽翻倍（如 8800 MT/s），成功突破了颗粒的物理频率瓶颈。\n\n---\n\n**总结回答你的特定问题：**\n*   **是否有飞书多维表格内容：** 没有，这是一张技术解说图。\n*   **是否有图片附件：** 图片内部没有嵌套附件。\n*   **字段显示什么：** 该图没有多维表格的“字段”，而是通过**标题、标注文字、流程箭头和架构示意图**来展示数据和技术原理。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/MRCDä½_ç_å_MRDIMMå_å_æ_ä---d491cf56-636b-4b34-a998-bdd6f751ca95.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774487608882}}
{"type":"message","id":"4f6b11cf","parentId":"d879637d","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:13:37.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The image is about DDR5 memory technology (MRCD/MCRDIMM), not a screenshot of the Feishu table. The user seems to have sent me an image about memory technology, possibly as a test or they're sharing something interesting.\n\nWait, looking at the message again - the user sent \"[File: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/...]\" - this looks like the user is showing me a screenshot of their table but the image analysis shows it's about DDR5 memory. \n\nActually, I think the user might be showing me the table but I need to look more carefully. The filename has Chinese characters that got encoded: \"MRCD如何提升DDR5内存带宽\" which translates to \"How MRCD improves DDR5 memory bandwidth\".\n \nSo the image is actually about DDR5 memory architecture, not the Feishu table itself. The filename \"MRCD如何提升DDR5内存带宽\" confirms this is a technical diagram about memory technology, and the image analysis confirms it shows RDIMM versus MCRDIMM architecture comparison.","thinkingSignature":"ec509e0c233d0a7c7080182dd7219cdb9c9e560b239249fc0093a61794f9d7b3"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n哈哈这张是 DDR5 内存的技术图，不是表格截图 😄\n\n不过你是不是想发表格的截图给我看？重新截一张表格的图发过来～\n\n或者直接告诉我：你在表格里看到「成都天气图」那条记录了吗？「图片附件」那个字段是空的吗？\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":16103,"output":285,"cacheRead":23226,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39614,"cost":{"input":0.0048309,"output":0.00034199999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0013935599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00656646}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774487608893,"responseId":"0613bb39894812d703dcbfa67cc1b701"}}
