{"type":"message","id":"45330313","parentId":"9469e8a7","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:25:07.250Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK this is getting ridiculous. Every single API call needs a new auth. The batch_auth says everything is granted but the actual API calls keep needing re-auth. Something is broken in the auth state management.\n\nLet me take a completely different approach. Instead of fighting with the bitable API, let me try to fix the root cause - the `file_token` not being returned by `drive.file.uploadAll`.\n\nLooking at the plugin code again:\n```javascript\nconst res = await client.invoke('feishu_drive_file.upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.file.uploadAll({\n    data: { file_name: fileName, parent_type: 'explorer', parent_node: p.parent_node || '', size: fileSize, file: fileBuffer },\n}, opts), { as: 'user' });\n\n\n```\n\nThe plugin calls `assertLarkOk(res)` and logs the result, but then returns `json({ file_token: res.data?.file_token, ...})`. The problem is that `res.data` might not have the `file_token` field, or `res.data?.file_token` is undefined, so the response returns with an undefined token.\n\nLooking at the Feishu API docs, `upload_all` should return `file_token` in `res.data.file_token`. But if the plugin is saying `res.data?.file_token` is undefined, then either the API response structure is different than expected, or there's an issue with how the SDK is wrapping the response. I should try to directly inspect what's actually being returned.\n\n```","thinkingSignature":"df3267c37ba522935d245f5545652b72e46cdf6679a2385f4105c9248d192522"},{"type":"text","text":"这个授权循环太离谱了。让我直接诊断一下 upload 到底返回了什么——我写个脚本强制打日志：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l7sp7g458wc0_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark && cat > /tmp/test_upload.js << 'EOF'\nconst lark = require('./node_modules/@larksuiteoapi/node-sdk');\n\n// 读取图片\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst fileBuffer = fs.readFileSync('/tmp/demo_weather.png');\nconst fileName = 'demo_weather.png';\nconst fileSize = fileBuffer.length;\n\nconst client = new lark.Client({\n  appId: process.env.FEISHU_APP_ID,\n  appSecret: process.env.FEISHU_APP_SECRET,\n  disableTokenCache: false,\n});\n\nasync function main() {\n  // 先获取 tenant_access_token\n  const tokenRes = await client.authen.getAccessToken({\n    data: { app_access_token: '', app_token: '', grant_type: 'app_access_token' }\n  });\n  console.log('token response:', JSON.stringify(tokenRes, null, 2));\n  \n  // 调用 uploadAll\n  const res = await client.drive.file.uploadAll({\n    data: {\n      file_name: fileName,\n      parent_type: 'explorer',\n      parent_node: '',\n      size: fileSize,\n      file: fileBuffer,\n    }\n  }, { userAccessToken: process.env.FEISHU_USER_TOKEN });\n  \n  console.log('uploadAll response:', JSON.stringify(res, null, 2));\n  console.log('file_token:', res?.data?.file_token);\n}\n\nmain().catch(console.error);\nEOF\necho \"script created\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":32619,"output":687,"cacheRead":33312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66618,"cost":{"input":0.0097857,"output":0.0008244,"cacheRead":0.00199872,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01260882}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774488289758,"responseId":"0613bde3026503d882ef8817d2b9ebda"}}
