{"type":"message","id":"b448793a","parentId":"1e037151","timestamp":"2026-03-26T01:58:40.085Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it! There's a file `demo_weather.png` with:\n- `token`: `O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd`\n- `url`: `https://tcnorh11898l.feishu.cn/file/O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd`\n\nWait, but the token from the file list is `O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd`, not starting with `file_` or `box_`. Let me check if this is the right format for bitable attachment.\n\nActually, the file token from the list API is `O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd`. \n\nNow I'll try attaching this token to the record.","thinkingSignature":"ab861b418987f393a790a4060ec32b437ee161d3dc83fe50455ebd306bcf4ab9"},{"type":"text","text":"找到文件了！`demo_weather.png` 的 token 是 `O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd`！\n\n现在用这个 token 写入附件字段：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l8nlppcwiwfu_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"update","app_token":"BeRBbpyd9a2eYusZbb1c7N4cn1f","table_id":"tbl3oA2By4N3FTPh","fields":{"图片附件":[{"file_token":"O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd"}]},"record_id":"recveVO3e6Ka1L"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43389,"output":356,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":33312,"totalTokens":77057,"cost":{"input":0.013016699999999999,"output":0.0004272,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.012492,"total":0.025935899999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774490305547,"responseId":"0613c5c33a2336ab79cc6058c1cff0bf"}}
