{"type":"message","id":"7246bba4","parentId":"21f4cb57","timestamp":"2026-03-26T02:21:53.024Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-26 10:21:51 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b537dcd2f60a4c2e68c9d37b7e25]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b537dcd2f60a4c2e68c9d37b7e25\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-26 10:21 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n？"}],"timestamp":1774491712986}}
{"type":"message","id":"21f6863f","parentId":"7246bba4","timestamp":"2026-03-26T02:22:10.637Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what's happening. Let me update them on the current status.\n\nThe issue is: \"The attachment does not belong to this bitable.\" - meaning the file token from the general drive doesn't work for attaching to a bitable record. The file needs to be uploaded specifically to the bitable's attachment system, not just the general drive.\n\nThis is a known limitation. Let me explain this to the user.","thinkingSignature":"54266ad36b2f09ef13dc84b0104726167c1d6dfd196641fc2e9c948ec42bcf8c"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n找到问题了！\n\n文件上传成功了，token 是 `O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd`，但写入时返回：\n\n> **\"The attachment does not belong to this bitable.\"**\n\n这说明——**飞书多维表格的附件字段不能直接引用云盘文件**，必须先把文件上传到多维表格自己的存储空间里。\n\n**两个不同的存储位置：**\n- 云盘（Drive）→ 通用文件存储\n- 多维表格附件 → 单独的存储，需要用专门的 API 上传\n\n**正确的多维表格附件上传方式**应该是：\n1. 先把文件上传到 bitable 专属存储（不是 drive）\n2. 获取 bitable 专用的 file_token\n3. 再写入附件字段\n\n但飞书插件的 `drive.file.uploadAll` 是上传到云盘，不是 bitable 存储，所以即便 token 拿到了也挂不上去。\n\n---\n\n**结论：这是飞书插件的功能缺失** —— `feishu_drive_file` 的 upload 是云盘 API，不是 bitable 附件 API。要完整支持多维表格图片上传，插件需要加一个 `bitable.upload_attachment` 之类的专用接口。\n\n要去 ClawHub 或 Discord 反馈一下这个问题，让插件作者加这个功能 👍\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":142,"output":360,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":71968,"totalTokens":72470,"cost":{"input":0.0000426,"output":0.000432,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.026988,"total":0.0274626}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774491713032,"responseId":"0613cb446e41c5e194940fdce08b28c3"}}
