{"type":"message","id":"74c914cb","parentId":"90829e96","timestamp":"2026-03-26T02:23:29.107Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking which document/table contains the final result of what we accomplished. Let me give them the link to the bitable we created.","thinkingSignature":"76b9ca0b2bf089cf2391fe66d41775b205ccad7a1e23eb36b96ac2d6a739271a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n<final>\n就是我们中途建的演示表 👇\n\n**🍎 苹果虾演示表**\n👉 https://tcnorh11898l.feishu.cn/base/BeRBbpyd9a2eYusZbb1c7N4cn1f\n\n里面有一张数据表叫「📷 图片演示」，\n- 第一条记录「成都天气图」→ 图片附件字段是**空的**（挂载失败）\n- 第二条记录「test2」→ 也是空的\n\n云盘里其实有 `demo_weather.png`（token: `O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd`），但多维表格不认这个 token，所以图片没能显示出来。\n\n你想的话可以直接打开上面的链接看看实际效果 📋\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":201,"cacheRead":72656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72857,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0.00024119999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00435936,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004600559999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774491797180,"responseId":"0613cb97eb707741bc3a376f1bf77ebe"}}
