{"type":"message","id":"ff99ccca","parentId":"10980672","timestamp":"2026-03-26T02:29:10.730Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Again the auth issue. Let me wait for the user to authorize. But you know what - every single API call is triggering a new auth card. This is really painful. Let me just tell the user the status.\n\nActually, let me think about the flow here. The issue is:\n1. Every API call triggers a new auth card\n2. The user has to click the link in the card and authorize\n3. Then I can proceed\n\nBut we know that:\n- `tools.profile` = \"full\" has already been set\n- `feishu_oauth_batch_auth` shows 20 permissions already granted\n- But individual API calls still trigger new auth cards\n\nThis seems like a fundamental issue with how the auto-auth flow works. The batch auth and per-call auth are not properly synchronized.\n\n\nI'm wondering if there's a timing issue - maybe the batch auth just completed but the system hasn't synced the granted permissions yet, so subsequent API calls still see them as missing and generate new auth cards. The loop of trying calls, getting blocked, sending batch auth, then having the user authorize only to loop again suggests something's broken in how the auth state is being communicated or refreshed between requests.\n\nBut practically speaking, we're stuck in this cycle and I should probably just tell the user we've hit a blocker and need to try again later.","thinkingSignature":"d1d035c133565a75efa9dcb3e79257b6e36e62eaebeb39d835ea7ab403a46dc4"},{"type":"text","text":"又触发授权了 😅\n\n**答案是：不行。**\n\n飞书多维表格的附件字段（type=17）**不接受 URL 链接**，只接受 bitable 内部存储的 file_token。\n\n绕路方案：\n- 把字段从「附件」改成「超链接」类型（type=15）→ 可以存 URL\n\n但每次建字段都要重新授权...授权循环实在太烦了 😩\n\n**先这样吧：**\n- 你去表格里手动把「图片附件」那一列删掉\n- 重新加一列，类型选「超链接」\n- 然后把 `https://tcnorh11898l.feishu.cn/file/O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd` 粘贴进去\n\n这样至少图片链接能显示出来，点击可以跳转到云盘查看图片。\n\n插件的 bug（drive upload 不返回 token）+ 授权循环，两个问题叠加，这个功能暂时没法全自动搞定 🙏"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":41703,"output":473,"cacheRead":33312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75488,"cost":{"input":0.0125109,"output":0.0005676,"cacheRead":0.00199872,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.015077219999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774492131902,"responseId":"0613cce60dab260a5f88b745e92ef828"}}
