      \\\"id\\\": \\\"reczXt4wo5\\\"        }    },    \\\"msg\\\": \\\"Success\\\"}`.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6c6c06d06ecb8aa9\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9998746\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"932365397564b45a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n使用多维表格附件字段 - Feishu\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"932365397564b45a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/articles/532389628624-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%A4%9A%E7%BB%B4%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ad1b54b286758fb7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n一、功能简介你可在附件字段中上传多种类型的文件，并在画册视图和看板视图中，将上传的图片或视频设置为封面，以主视觉的形式展示。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ad1b54b286758fb7\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.999826\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"飞书多维表格 bitable 附件字段 上传图片 API file_token","provider":"tavily","count":5,"tookMs":2411,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"tavily","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"87a17f387acdae49\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n通过飞书api将图片传递给多维表格 - 知乎专栏\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"87a17f387acdae49\">>>","url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1892619884107641728","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"761ad24186946ce7\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n第一、上传附件或图片，获取存储位置即\"file_token\". 第二、在多维表格新增记录，调用附件的位置\"file_token\". 3、执行如下. 3.1上传素材. 3.2获取\"\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"761ad24186946ce7\">>>","score":0.9999609},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"054acb8a7942b7bf\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n多维表格常见问题- 开发文档- 飞书开放平台\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"054acb8a7942b7bf\">>>","url":"https://open.feishu.cn/document/docs/bitable-v1/faq?lang=zh-CN","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d0cec4c77c7a3a4f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n**第 1 步**：调用上传素材或分片上传素材接口将附件上传至多维表格，获取文件的 file_token。. **第 2 步**：调用新增记录或更新记录接口，将 file_token 的值传入多维表格中。请求示例如下所示：. **第 1 步**：调用查询记录获取多维表格中附件的 file_token。. `{  \"code\": 0,  \"data\": {    \"has_more\": false,    \"items\": [      {        \"fields\": {          \"附件\": [            {              \"file_token\": \"RSkabsaphoy6yVxK0mGcggabcef\",              \"name\": \"74d2c703524489dbabcef.png\",              \"size\": 87123,              \"tmp_url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/batch_get_tmp_download_url? file_tokens=RSkabsaphoy6yVxK0mGcggabcef&extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblz8ExGaVhuiSD1\",\"rev\":32}}\",  // 素材临时下载链接对应的 URL 值，需要对此字符串进行 URL 编码              \"type\": \"image/png\",              \"url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/RSkabsaphoy6yVxK0mGcggabcef/download? extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblz8ExGaVhuiSD1\",\"rev\":32}}\"   // 下载素材对应的 URL 值，需要对此字符串进行 URL 编码            }          ]        },        \"record_id\": \"recbMzD0zT\"      }    ],    \"total\": 1  },  \"msg\": \"success\"}`. `{\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblO6OeNZxfabcef\",\"attachments\":{\"fld32zZi5I\":{\"rec0BuOHq\":[\"boxbcsQNT0JsmrztOnX530abcef\"]}}}}// 转义后https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/boxbcsQNT0JsmrztOnX530abcef/download? 对于人员字段，你需在 value 中传入人员的用户 ID。用户 ID 的类型与查询记录接口中查询参数 `user_id_type` 指定的类型一致，默认为 Open ID 类型。以下为筛选人员 ID 为 `ou_00d9ea2d7bcd6b6aa7d71dd88deabcef` 和 `ou_5fdfc3d312b24d28224769baf52abcef` 的请求示例：. `{  \"view_id\": \"vewfrk8iX4\",  \"field_names\": [    \"创建人\"  ],  \"filter\": {    \"conjunction\": \"and\",    \"conditions\": [      {        \"field_name\": \"创建人\",        \"operator\": \"contains\",        \"value\": [          \"ou_00d9ea2d7bcd6b6aa7d71dd88deabcef\",          \"ou_5fdfc3d312b24d28224769baf52abcef\"        ]      }    ]  }}`. `{  \"view_id\": \"vewfrk8iX4\",  \"field_names\": [],  \"filter\": {    \"conjunction\": \"and\",    \"conditions\": [      {        \"field_name\": \"编号\",        \"operator\": \"isGreater\",        \"value\": [          \"9\"        ]      },      {        \"field_name\": \"编号\",        \"operator\": \"isLess\",        \"value\": [          \"21\"        ]      }    ]  }}`. `{  \"view_id\": \"vewfrk8iX4\",  // 请替换为实际的 view_id  \"filter\": {    \"conjunction\": \"and\",    \"conditions\": []  }}`.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d0cec4c77c7a3a4f\">>>","score":0.9999422},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"810bea40d4f7144b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n素材概述 - 飞书API\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"810bea40d4f7144b\">>>","url":"https://feishu.apifox.cn/doc-412743","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9db2d6d8b64275a0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n# 素材概述. 上传素材指将素材（图片/文件）上传到指定云文档中。素材文件在云空间中不会显示，只会显示在对应云文档中。. ## 上传点类型及对应标识符（token）#. ## 上传点类型及对应Scope说明#. | `doc_image` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理文档 请参考应用权限 |. | `doc_file` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理文档 请参考应用权限 |. | `docx_image` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理文档 请参考应用权限 |. | `docx_file` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理文档 请参考应用权限 |. | `sheet_image` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理电子表格 请参考应用权限 |. | `sheet_file` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理电子表格 请参考应用权限 |. | `bitable_image` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理多维表格 请参考应用权限 |. | `bitable_file` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理多维表格 请参考应用权限 |. | `ccm_import_open` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 请参考应用权限 |. ## 上传点类型及对应Extra说明#. ### ccm\\_import\\_open#. 使用导入接口前，需要上传需要导入的文件，对应的parent\\_node无需填写，extra填入json序列化后的字符串。. ### bitable\\_image/bitable\\_file#. type Extra struct { BitablePerm struct { TableId string `json:\"tableId\"` Attachments map[string]map[string][]string `json:\"attachments\"` } `json:\"bitablePerm\"` }. 根据附件所在的字段、记录id和文件token，填写attachments参数；其中attachments第一个key为字段id，第二个key为记录id，value为文件token数组；. {\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\": \"tblO6OeNZxfabcef\", \"attachments\":{\"fld32zZi5I\":{\"rec0BuOHq\":[\"boxbcsQNT0JsmrztOnX530abcef\"]}}}}// 转义后://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/boxbcsQNT0JsmrztOnX530abcef/download? extra=%7B%22bitablePerm%22%3A%7B%22tableId%22%3A%22tblO6OeNZxfabcef%22%2C%22attachments%22%3A%7B%22fld32zZi5I%22%3A%7B%22rec0BuOHq%22%3A%5B%22boxbcsQNT0JsmrztOnX530abcef%22%5D%7D%7D%7D%7D. 用微信扫右侧二维码，加入【飞书】API开发者 交流群，互助沟通. 修改于 2023-01-13 05:54:42.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9db2d6d8b64275a0\">>>","score":0.9998785},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e1da3fc65b80f855\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n附件字段说明- 开发文档- 飞书开放平台 - Feishu Open Platform\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e1da3fc65b80f855\">>>","url":"https://open.feishu.cn/document/server-docs/docs/bitable-v1/app-table-field/attachment?lang=zh-CN","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6c6c06d06ecb8aa9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n# 附件字段说明 - 服务端 API - 开发文档 - 飞书开放平台. `{  \"任务附件\": [    {      \"file_token\": \"boxcnzm3dPEcutYDPplx5iDak4b\",      \"name\": \"Hawaii_1_15Retina_R.jpg\",      \"size\": 5069121,      \"tmp_url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/batch_get_tmp_download_url? file_tokens=boxcnzm3dPEcutYDPplx5iDak4b\",      \"type\": \"image/jpeg\",      \"url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/boxcnzm3dPEcutYDPplx5iDak4b/download\"    }]}`. `{    \"code\": 0,    \"data\": {        \"records\": [            {                \"fields\": {                    \"附件\": [                        {                            \"file_token\": \"boxbcCFb2dBwMK9S8kDILk1tayh\"                        },                        {                            \"file_token\": \"boxbcCFb2dBwMK9S8kDILk1tayh\"                        }                    ]                },                \"id\": \"recxgOKlB0\"            },                        {                \"fields\": {                    \"附件\": [                        {                            \"file_token\": \"boxbcCFb2dBwMK9S8kDILk1tayh\"                        },                        {                            \"file_token\": \"boxbcCFb2dBwMK9S8kDILk1tayh\"                        }                    ]                },                \"id\": \"reciGVHpI8\"            }        ]    },    \"msg\": \"Success\"}`. `{    \"code\": 0,    \"data\": {        \"record\": {            \"fields\": {                \"人力评估\": \"8\",                \"任务执行人\": [                    {                        \"annotation_union_type\": \"person\",                        \"email\": \"\",                        \"en_name\": \"周北北\",                        \"id\": \"ou_be7f7ff11f5107962c0493f59409508b\",                        \"name\": \"周北北\"                    }                ],                \"任务描述\": \"功能开发\",                \"任务附件\": [                    {                        \"file_token\": \"boxcn8Ebe2Z68hXTsW8t1TuZCSd\",                        \"name\": \"2.gif\",                        \"size\": 10250625,                        \"tmp_url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/batch_get_tmp_download_url? file_tokens=boxcn8Ebe2Z68hXTsW8t1TuZCSd\",                        \"type\": \"image/gif\",                        \"url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/boxcn8Ebe2Z68hXTsW8t1TuZCSd/download\"                    }                ],                \"对应 OKR\": [                    {                        \"text\": \"KR 2.2 推进新功能研发,KR 2.3 修补已知功能漏洞\",                        \"type\": \"text\"                    }                ],                \"截止日期\": 1612108800000,                \"未命名 1\": null,                \"状态\": \"开发中\",                \"相关部门\": [                    \"研发\"                ]            },            \"id\": \"reczXt4wo5\"        }    },    \"msg\": \"Success\"}`.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6c6c06d06ecb8aa9\">>>","score":0.9998746},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"932365397564b45a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n使用多维表格附件字段 - Feishu\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"932365397564b45a\">>>","url":"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/articles/532389628624-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%A4%9A%E7%BB%B4%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ad1b54b286758fb7\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n一、功能简介你可在附件字段中上传多种类型的文件，并在画册视图和看板视图中，将上传的图片或视频设置为封面，以主视觉的形式展示。\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ad1b54b286758fb7\">>>","score":0.999826}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774494839799}}
{"type":"message","id":"b71a379e","parentId":"30305891","timestamp":"2026-03-26T03:14:32.151Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it! The key is in the search results:\n\n1. From the Feishu docs: **上传素材** (upload media) - not `drive.file.uploadAll` - but `drive.media.upload_all` with `bitable_image` or `bitable_file` type\n2. The critical insight from the apifox doc: the upload needs `bitable_image` or `bitable_file` as the upload type, and you need to specify `extra` with `bitablePerm` containing the table ID, field ID, and record ID.\n\nThe flow is:\n1. Call `POST /open-apis/drive/v1/medias/upload_all` with `file_type=bitable_image` (or `bitable_file`) and `extra` containing `bitablePerm` with table ID, field ID, record ID\n\n\n2. This returns a `file_token` starting with `boxcn...` that's scoped to that specific bitable field\n3. Then when updating the record, I just pass that `file_token` and it should link properly\n\nSo the key difference is using the media upload endpoint with the bitable file type, which gives me the right token format for attachment fields.\n\nBut wait—the plugin uses `drive.file.uploadAll` which uploads to Drive, not the bitable-specific storage. That's the mismatch. I could try invoking the Feishu API directly using curl with the access token, but I don't have the user's access token readily available. Let me look more closely at that search result to see exactly what the correct approach should be.\n\nThe key is calling `POST /open-apis/drive/v1/medias/upload_all` with `file_type=bitable_image`, and then passing the response `file_token` when updating the record. But here's the problem: I need the field_id for the attachment field, which I don't have yet. When I list the fields, I only get field names and IDs for that specific bitable, so I could retrieve the field list to find the attachment field's ID.\n\nThen I'd need to construct the extra parameter with bitablePerm containing the table ID, field ID, and record ID, and use that when uploading the image to get the file token needed for the record update.\n\nLooking at the Feishu API docs more carefully though, the file_token returned from the upload starts with `boxcn` and gets returned directly when updating the record's attachment field. So the actual workflow is to first upload the image using the media upload API, then pass the resulting file_token when creating or updating the record.\n\nI need to figure out whether the Feishu Lark SDK has a `drive.media.upload_all` method or if I need to call the HTTP endpoint directly. Let me also double-check that the error I'm seeing—\"The attachment does not belong to this bitable\"—actually means the token format is wrong, not that there's a permissions issue with how I'm uploading to the bitable storage.\n\nLooking at the API documentation more carefully, I see that `drive.file.upload_all` and `drive.media.upload_all` are different endpoints with different response formats. The media endpoint returns `file_token` values starting with `boxcn`, while the file endpoint returns different formats. I should try using the media upload endpoint instead.\n\nHowever, the plugin doesn't expose `drive.media.upload_all` directly, so I'd need to find another way to access it—either through a different tool or by calling the Feishu API directly with a curl request, though that would require the user's access token which I don't have readily available.\n\nLet me look for existing solutions online to see how others have handled this problem.","thinkingSignature":"e24dd58dda8f3643f689716d6256211be0b414ba79e6a068aeaec337900b12c3"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0ay7c6f5i6gr_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1892619884107641728","maxChars":5000}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":45722,"output":800,"cacheRead":33312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79834,"cost":{"input":0.013716599999999999,"output":0.0009599999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00199872,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.016675319999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774494839815,"responseId":"0613d779570db3bb2f2a26d501af5b84"}}
