{"type":"message","id":"d43d3180","parentId":"ce439686","timestamp":"2026-03-26T03:45:23.732Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's already a `feishu_doc_media` tool that uses `drive.v1.media.uploadAll`! Let me look at how this tool works and see if it can be used for bitable attachments.\n\nThe `feishu_doc_media` tool has an `insert` action that calls `sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll`. Let me read this code to understand what it does.","thinkingSignature":"f45ee4da7d7fdbbb5c1c4d0882c122eec0e1debc2f3564a54347f91e51c03981"},{"type":"text","text":"`fe"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":49512,"output":0,"cacheRead":33312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82824,"cost":{"input":0.0148536,"output":0,"cacheRead":0.00199872,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01685232}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1774494899443,"responseId":"0613d7b554445cccd0f2fc39cf9560e6","errorMessage":"terminated"}}
{"type":"message","id":"36792196","parentId":"d43d3180","timestamp":"2026-03-26T03:45:36.812Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's a `feishu_doc_media` tool that uses `sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll`. Let me check what that tool does.","thinkingSignature":"fc562e19ef02454200dfbcf63818c4ced61d4f47cc4f03075a7c380542e48167"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ftsj1gq64shv_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":49512,"output":77,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":33312,"totalTokens":82901,"cost":{"input":0.0148536,"output":0.0000924,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.012492,"total":0.027437999999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774496726072,"responseId":"0613dedbe19faaea02c5b5c338c5a94e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6d00de58","parentId":"36792196","timestamp":"2026-03-26T03:45:37.225Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ftsj1gq64shv_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"use strict\";\n/**\n * Copyright (c) 2026 ByteDance Ltd. and/or its affiliates\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n *\n * feishu_doc_media tool -- 文档媒体管理（插入 + 下载）\n *\n * Actions:\n *   insert   - 在飞书文档末尾插入本地图片或文件（3 步流程）\n *   download - 下载文档素材或画板缩略图到本地\n *\n * 使用以下 SDK 接口:\n * - sdk.docx.documentBlockChildren.create - 创建子块\n * - sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll - 上传素材\n * - sdk.docx.documentBlock.batchUpdate - 批量更新块\n * - sdk.drive.v1.media.download - 下载素材\n * - sdk.board.v1.whiteboard.downloadAsImage - 下载画板缩略图\n */\n/* eslint-disable @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any */\nvar __createBinding = (this && this.__createBinding) || (Object.create ? (function(o, m, k, k2) {\n    if (k2 === undefined) k2 = k;\n    var desc = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(m, k);\n    if (!desc || (\"get\" in desc ? !m.__esModule : desc.writable || desc.configurable)) {\n      desc = { enumerable: true, get: function() { return m[k]; } };\n    }\n    Object.defineProperty(o, k2, desc);\n}) : (function(o, m, k, k2) {\n    if (k2 === undefined) k2 = k;\n    o[k2] = m[k];\n}));\nvar __setModuleDefault = (this && this.__setModuleDefault) || (Object.create ? (function(o, v) {\n    Object.defineProperty(o, \"default\", { enumerable: true, value: v });\n}) : function(o, v) {\n    o[\"default\"] = v;\n});\nvar __importStar = (this && this.__importStar) || (function () {\n    var ownKeys = function(o) {\n        ownKeys = Object.getOwnPropertyNames || function (o) {\n            var ar = [];\n            for (var k in o) if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(o, k)) ar[ar.length] = k;\n            return ar;\n        };\n        return ownKeys(o);\n    };\n    return function (mod) {\n        if (mod && mod.__esModule) return mod;\n        var result = {};\n        if (mod != null) for (var k = ownKeys(mod), i = 0; i < k.length; i++) if (k[i] !== \"default\") __createBinding(result, mod, k[i]);\n        __setModuleDefault(result, mod);\n        return result;\n    };\n})();\nObject.defineProperty(exports, \"__esModule\", { value: true });\nexports.registerDocMediaTool = registerDocMediaTool;\nconst typebox_1 = require(\"@sinclair/typebox\");\nconst helpers_1 = require(\"../helpers.js\");\nconst media_url_utils_1 = require(\"../../../messaging/outbound/media-url-utils.js\");\nconst fs = __importStar(require(\"node:fs/promises\"));\nconst node_fs_1 = require(\"node:fs\");\nconst os = __importStar(require(\"node:os\"));\nconst path = __importStar(require(\"node:path\"));\nconst image_size_1 = require(\"image-size\");\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Constants\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nconst MAX_FILE_SIZE = 20 * 1024 * 1024; // 20MB\nconst ALIGN_MAP = {\n    left: 1,\n    center: 2,\n    right: 3,\n};\n/** 插入时的媒体类型配置 */\nconst MEDIA_CONFIG = {\n    image: {\n        block_type: 27,\n        block_data: { image: {} },\n        parent_type: 'docx_image',\n        label: '图片',\n    },\n    file: {\n        block_type: 23,\n        block_data: { file: { token: '' } },\n        parent_type: 'docx_file',\n        label: '文件',\n    },\n};\n/** MIME type → 扩展名映射 */\nconst MIME_TO_EXT = {\n    'image/png': '.png',\n    'image/jpeg': '.jpg',\n    'image/jpg': '.jpg',\n    'image/gif': '.gif',\n    'image/webp': '.webp',\n    'image/svg+xml': '.svg',\n    'image/bmp': '.bmp',\n    'image/tiff': '.tiff',\n    'video/mp4': '.mp4',\n    'video/mpeg': '.mpeg',\n    'video/quicktime': '.mov',\n    'video/x-msvideo': '.avi',\n    'video/webm': '.webm',\n    'application/pdf': '.pdf',\n    'application/msword': '.doc',\n    'application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document': '.docx',\n    'application/vnd.ms-excel': '.xls',\n    'application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet': '.xlsx',\n    'application/vnd.ms-powerpoint': '.ppt',\n    'application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation': '.pptx',\n    'application/zip': '.zip',\n    'application/x-rar-compressed': '.rar',\n    'text/plain': '.txt',\n    'application/json': '.json',\n};\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Helpers\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n/**\n * 从文档 URL 或纯 ID 中提取 document_id\n */\nfunction extractDocumentId(input) {\n    const trimmed = input.trim();\n    const urlMatch = trimmed.match(/\\/docx\\/([A-Za-z0-9]+)/);\n    if (urlMatch)\n        return urlMatch[1];\n    return trimmed;\n}\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Schema\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nconst DocMediaSchema = typebox_1.Type.Union([\n    // INSERT action\n    typebox_1.Type.Object({\n        action: typebox_1.Type.Literal('insert'),\n        doc_id: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '文档 ID 或文档 URL（必填）。支持从 URL 自动提取 document_id',\n        }),\n        file_path: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '本地文件的绝对路径（必填）。图片支持 jpg/png/gif/webp 等，文件支持任意格式，最大 20MB',\n        }),\n        type: typebox_1.Type.Optional((0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['image', 'file'], {\n            description: '媒体类型：\"image\"（图片，默认）或 \"file\"（文件附件）',\n        })),\n        align: typebox_1.Type.Optional((0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['left', 'center', 'right'], {\n            description: '对齐方式（仅图片生效）：\"center\"（默认居中）、\"left\"（居左）、\"right\"（居右）',\n        })),\n        caption: typebox_1.Type.Optional(typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '图片描述/标题（可选，仅图片生效）',\n        })),\n    }),\n    // DOWNLOAD action\n    typebox_1.Type.Object({\n        action: typebox_1.Type.Literal('download'),\n        resource_token: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '资源的唯一标识（file_token 用于文档素材，whiteboard_id 用于画板）',\n        }),\n        resource_type: (0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['media', 'whiteboard'], {\n            description: '资源类型：media（文档素材：图片、视频、文件等）或 whiteboard（画板缩略图）',\n        }),\n        output_path: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '保存文件的完整本地路径。可以包含扩展名（如 /tmp/image.png），' +\n                '也可以不带扩展名，系统会根据 Content-Type 自动添加',\n        }),\n    }),\n]);\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Action handlers\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nasync function handleInsert(p, client, log) {\n    const documentId = extractDocumentId(p.doc_id);\n    const mediaType = p.type ?? 'image';\n    const config = MEDIA_CONFIG[mediaType];\n    // 0. 路径白名单校验 — 仅允许 tmpdir 下的文件\n    const filePath = p.file_path;\n    const DOC_MEDIA_ALLOWED_ROOTS = [os.tmpdir()];\n    (0, media_url_utils_1.validateLocalMediaRoots)(path.resolve(filePath), DOC_MEDIA_ALLOWED_ROOTS);\n    // 1. 读取并校验本地文件\n    let fileSize;\n    try {\n        const stat = await fs.stat(filePath);\n        fileSize = stat.size;\n    }\n    catch (err) {\n        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n            error: `failed to read file: ${err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err)}`,\n        });\n    }\n    if (fileSize > MAX_FILE_SIZE) {\n        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n            error: `file ${(fileSize / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(1)}MB exceeds 20MB limit`,\n        });\n    }\n    const fileName = path.basename(filePath);\n    log.info(`insert: doc=${documentId}, type=${mediaType}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n    // 2. 创建空 Block（追加到文档末尾）\n    const createRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.insert', (sdk, opts) => sdk.docx.documentBlockChildren.create({\n        path: {\n            document_id: documentId,\n            block_id: documentId,\n        },\n        data: {\n            children: [{ block_type: config.block_type, ...config.block_data }],\n        },\n        params: { document_revision_id: -1 },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });\n    (0, helpers_1.assertLarkOk)(createRes);\n    // File Block 返回 View Block（block_type: 33）作为容器，\n    // 真正的 File Block ID 在 children[0].children[0]；\n    // Image Block 直接返回，block_id 在 children[0].block_id\n    let blockId;\n    if (mediaType === 'file') {\n        blockId = createRes.data?.children?.[0]?.children?.[0];\n    }\n    else {\n        blockId = createRes.data?.children?.[0]?.block_id;\n    }\n    if (!blockId) {\n        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n            error: `failed to create ${config.label} block: no block_id returned`,\n        });\n    }\n    log.info(`insert: created ${mediaType} block ${blockId}`);\n    // 3. 上传素材\n    const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.insert', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n        data: {\n            file_name: fileName,\n            parent_type: config.parent_type,\n            parent_node: blockId,\n            size: fileSize,\n            file: (0, node_fs_1.createReadStream)(filePath),\n            extra: JSON.stringify({\n                drive_route_token: documentId,\n            }),\n        },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });\n    const fileToken = uploadRes?.file_token ?? uploadRes?.data?.file_token;\n    if (!fileToken) {\n        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n            error: `failed to upload ${config.label} media: no file_token returned`,\n        });\n    }\n    log.info(`insert: uploaded media, file_token=${fileToken}`);\n    // 4. 批量更新 Block - 设置 token\n    const patchRequest = { block_id: blockId };\n    if (mediaType === 'image') {\n        const alignNum = ALIGN_MAP[p.align ?? 'center'];\n        // 自动检测图片尺寸\n        let width;\n        let height;\n        try {\n            const imgBuf = await fs.readFile(filePath);\n            const dims = (0, image_size_1.imageSize)(imgBuf);\n            if (dims.width && dims.height) {\n                width = dims.width;\n                height = dims.height;\n                log.info(`insert: detected image size ${width}x${height}`);\n            }\n        }\n        catch {\n            log.info('insert: could not detect image dimensions, skipping');\n        }\n        patchRequest.replace_image = {\n            token: fileToken,\n            align: alignNum,\n            ...(width != null ? { width } : {}),\n            ...(height != null ? { height } : {}),\n            ...(p.caption ? { caption: { content: p.caption } } : {}),\n        };\n    }\n    else {\n        patchRequest.replace_file = { token: fileToken };\n    }\n    const patchRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.insert', (sdk, opts) => sdk.docx.documentBlock.batchUpdate({\n        path: { document_id: documentId },\n        data: { requests: [patchRequest] },\n        params: { document_revision_id: -1 },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });\n    (0, helpers_1.assertLarkOk)(patchRes);\n    log.info(`insert: patched ${mediaType} block with file_token`);\n    return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n        success: true,\n        type: mediaType,\n        document_id: documentId,\n        block_id: blockId,\n        file_token: fileToken,\n        file_name: fileName,\n    });\n}\nasync function handleDownload(p, client, log) {\n    log.info(`download: resource_type=${p.resource_type}, token=\"${p.resource_token}\"`);\n    let res;\n    if (p.resource_type === 'media') {\n        res = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.download', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.download({ path: { file_token: p.resource_token } }, opts), { as: 'user' });\n    }\n    else {\n        res = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.download', (sdk, opts) => sdk.board.v1.whiteboard.downloadAsImage({ path: { whiteboard_id: p.resource_token } }, opts), { as: 'user' });\n    }\n    // 读取二进制流\n    const stream = res.getReadableStream();\n    const chunks = [];\n    for await (const chunk of stream) {\n        chunks.push(chunk);\n    }\n    const buffer = Buffer.concat(chunks);\n    log.info(`download: received ${buffer.length} bytes`);\n    // 从 Content-Type 推断扩展名\n    const contentType = res.headers?.['content-type'] || '';\n    let finalPath = p.output_path;\n    const currentExt = path.extname(p.output_path);\n    if (!currentExt && contentType) {\n        const mimeType = contentType.split(';')[0].trim();\n        const defaultExt = p.resource_type === 'whiteboard' ? '.png' : undefined;\n        const suggestedExt = MIME_TO_EXT[mimeType] || defaultExt;\n        if (suggestedExt) {\n            finalPath = p.output_path + suggestedExt;\n            log.info(`download: auto-detected extension ${suggestedExt}`);\n        }\n    }\n    // 确保父目录存在并保存\n    await fs.mkdir(path.dirname(finalPath), { recursive: true });\n    try {\n        await fs.writeFile(finalPath, buffer);\n        log.info(`download: saved to ${finalPath}`);\n    }\n    catch (err) {\n        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n            error: `failed to save file: ${err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err)}`,\n        });\n    }\n    return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n        resource_type: p.resource_type,\n        resource_token: p.resource_token,\n        size_bytes: buffer.length,\n        content_type: contentType,\n        saved_path: finalPath,\n    });\n}\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Registration\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nfunction registerDocMediaTool(api) {\n    if (!api.config)\n        return false;\n    const cfg = api.config;\n    const { toolClient, log } = (0, helpers_1.createToolContext)(api, 'feishu_doc_media');\n    return (0, helpers_1.registerTool)(api, {\n        name: 'feishu_doc_media',\n        label: 'Feishu: Document Media',\n        description: '【以用户身份】文档媒体管理工具。' +\n            '支持两种操作：' +\n            '(1) insert - 在飞书文档末尾插入本地图片或文件（需要文档 ID + 本地文件路径）；' +\n            '(2) download - 下载文档素材或画板缩略图到本地（需要资源 token + 输出路径）。' +\n            '\\n\\n【重要】insert 仅支持本地文件路径。URL 图片请使用 create-doc/update-doc 的 <image url=\"...\"/> 语法。',\n        parameters: DocMediaSchema,\n        async execute(_toolCallId, params) {\n            const p = params;\n            try {\n                const client = toolClient();\n                if (p.action === 'insert') {\n                    return await handleInsert(p, client, log);\n                }\n                if (p.action === 'download') {\n                    return await handleDownload(p, client, log);\n                }\n                return (0, helpers_1.json)({ error: `unknown action: ${p.action}` });\n            }\n            catch (err) {\n                return await (0, helpers_1.handleInvokeErrorWithAutoAuth)(err, cfg);\n            }\n        },\n    }, { name: 'feishu_doc_media' });\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774496737125}}
{"type":"message","id":"ccf90a54","parentId":"6d00de58","timestamp":"2026-03-26T03:46:01.442Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue now. The `feishu_doc_media` tool uses `sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll` but only for inserting into **docx documents** (using `docx_image` and `docx_file` as `parent_type`). It doesn't support `bitable_image` or `bitable_file` as the parent_type.\n\nBut the doc-media tool has the right API (media.uploadAll) - it just needs the right `parent_type` and `extra` parameters for bitable attachments.\n\nLooking at the code:\n```javascript\nconst MEDIA_CONFIG = {\n    image: {\n        block_type: 27,\n        block_data: { image: {} },\n        parent_type: 'docx_image',  // <- specific to docx\n        label: '图片',\n    },\n    file: {\n        block_type: 23,\n        block_data: { file: { token: '' } },\n        parent_type: 'docx_file',  // <- specific to docx\n        label: '文件',\n    },\n};\n```\n\nAnd the upload:\n```javascript\nuploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.insert', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n    data: {\n        file_name: fileName,\n        parent_type: config.parent_type,  // docx_image or docx_file\n        parent_node: blockId,\n        size: fileSize,\n        file: createReadStream(filePath),\n        extra: JSON.stringify({\n            drive_route_token: documentId,\n        }),\n    },\n}, opts), { as: 'user' });\n```\n\nThe problem is clear: this tool is hardcoded to use `docx_image` and `docx_file` parent types, but bitable attachments need `bitable_image` or `bitable_file` instead. I'd need to add a separate bitable-specific action to `feishu_doc_media` that uses the correct parent types and includes the proper extra parameters for table and field IDs. Or more directly, I could modify the upload logic to support bitable attachments by passing the right `parent_type` and constructing the `extra` field with the necessary bitable permissions metadata. For `bitable_image` uploads, the `extra` field needs a `bitablePerm` object containing the `tableId`, while `bitable_file` uploads require additional attachment tracking in the same structure.\n\nThe current `feishu_doc_media` tool only supports `docx_image` and `docx_file` parent types, so to enable bitable uploads, I'd need to create a new action within that tool that handles the bitable case by setting the correct parent_type and building the proper `bitablePerm` extra structure with the table ID, field ID, and record ID.\n\nI think the best path forward is to implement a `bitable_attachments` action in `feishu_doc_media` that accepts a file path and the bitable identifiers, then uses the media upload endpoint with the right parameters to attach the file directly to a bitable record.\n\nImplementing this would require adding a new action to the tool, which I can do since I have access to the source files. I could write a script to add this functionality, or suggest it as a feature request to the plugin maintainer. Let me start by writing the new action directly into the doc-media.js file, then reload the plugin to test it out.","thinkingSignature":"546e86bea99b9535ad2838a682aafc215ee6574bbf4b90e0888aa743ca04f6bd"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！`feishu_doc_media` 工具内部调用了 `sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll`（正确 API），但只支持 `docx_image`/`docx_file` 类型，不支持 `bitable_image`！\n\n这就是问题根源——**SDK 有正确的接口**，只是插件没有暴露 bitable 附件上传的路径。\n\n我来给插件打补丁，加上 bitable 附件上传的支持：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1cd1t1s8n147_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js","limit":80}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":53278,"output":843,"cacheRead":33312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87433,"cost":{"input":0.0159834,"output":0.0010115999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00199872,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01899372}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":177449673723