{"type":"message","id":"fc04c6c3","parentId":"ba796db8","timestamp":"2026-03-26T03:46:28.780Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The field list tool also needs authorization. Let me check - we already have the field IDs from when we created the table. From the earlier creation response:```\n\"field_id_list\": [\"fldLeqDBoN\", \"fld9qWZcrV\"]\n```The default table had fields: \"名称\" (type 1) and \"图片附件\" (type 17). The first field \"名称\" is probably `fldLeqDBoN` and \"图片附件\" is `fld9qWZcrV`.\n\nNow let me patch the doc-media.js to add bitable_upload support. I need to add:1. \n\nNew action type in the schema (bitable_upload)2. A handler function that calls `sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll` with proper `extra` containing `bitablePerm`3. Update the execute function to route to the new handler\n\nThe `extra` for bitable should be:\n```json\n{\n  \"bitablePerm\": {\n    \"tableId\": \"tbl3oA2By4N3FTPh\",\n    \"attachments\": {\n      \"fld9qWZcrV\": {  // field_id of attachment field\n        \"recveVO3e6Ka1L\": [\"boxcnxxx\"]  // record_id: [file_token]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nI realize this approach is getting complicated. The simpler path is to just upload the media file first and get its token, then update the record separately with that token. Let me look at how the existing upload handler works in doc-media.js to understand the right way to structure this.\n\nThe issue is that `parent_node` needs to be the block_id for docx, but for bitable it needs different handling. For bitable specifically, when calling `media.uploadAll` with `parent_type: 'bitable_image'`, the `extra` parameter should contain the bitable permission structure with the table ID, field ID, and record ID all nested together.\n\nRather than trying to handle this through existing parameters, the cleanest solution is to create a dedicated `bitable_upload` action that constructs the proper `bitablePerm` object in the `extra` field. I should modify the doc-media tool to add this new action.","thinkingSignature":"9b9f51dc66922d2b0a36ff5da8b3a493ac701fc65fbed8fb4d52c3fc73899cf6"},{"type":"text","text":"好，现在我知道字段 ID 了：`fld9qWZcrV`（图片附件字段）。开始给插件打补丁，添加 bitable 附件上传支持：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ovlltlz11bc6_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js","offset":81,"limit":120}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":55288,"output":573,"cacheRead":33312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89173,"cost":{"input":0.016586399999999998,"output":0.0006876,"cacheRead":0.00199872,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.019272719999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774496772496,"responseId":"0613df0570287fe130afe46926a4381d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7719156a","parentId":"fc04c6c3","timestamp":"2026-03-26T03:46:28.816Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ovlltlz11bc6_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        block_type: 23,\n        block_data: { file: { token: '' } },\n        parent_type: 'docx_file',\n        label: '文件',\n    },\n};\n/** MIME type → 扩展名映射 */\nconst MIME_TO_EXT = {\n    'image/png': '.png',\n    'image/jpeg': '.jpg',\n    'image/jpg': '.jpg',\n    'image/gif': '.gif',\n    'image/webp': '.webp',\n    'image/svg+xml': '.svg',\n    'image/bmp': '.bmp',\n    'image/tiff': '.tiff',\n    'video/mp4': '.mp4',\n    'video/mpeg': '.mpeg',\n    'video/quicktime': '.mov',\n    'video/x-msvideo': '.avi',\n    'video/webm': '.webm',\n    'application/pdf': '.pdf',\n    'application/msword': '.doc',\n    'application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document': '.docx',\n    'application/vnd.ms-excel': '.xls',\n    'application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet': '.xlsx',\n    'application/vnd.ms-powerpoint': '.ppt',\n    'application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation': '.pptx',\n    'application/zip': '.zip',\n    'application/x-rar-compressed': '.rar',\n    'text/plain': '.txt',\n    'application/json': '.json',\n};\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Helpers\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n/**\n * 从文档 URL 或纯 ID 中提取 document_id\n */\nfunction extractDocumentId(input) {\n    const trimmed = input.trim();\n    const urlMatch = trimmed.match(/\\/docx\\/([A-Za-z0-9]+)/);\n    if (urlMatch)\n        return urlMatch[1];\n    return trimmed;\n}\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Schema\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nconst DocMediaSchema = typebox_1.Type.Union([\n    // INSERT action\n    typebox_1.Type.Object({\n        action: typebox_1.Type.Literal('insert'),\n        doc_id: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '文档 ID 或文档 URL（必填）。支持从 URL 自动提取 document_id',\n        }),\n        file_path: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '本地文件的绝对路径（必填）。图片支持 jpg/png/gif/webp 等，文件支持任意格式，最大 20MB',\n        }),\n        type: typebox_1.Type.Optional((0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['image', 'file'], {\n            description: '媒体类型：\"image\"（图片，默认）或 \"file\"（文件附件）',\n        })),\n        align: typebox_1.Type.Optional((0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['left', 'center', 'right'], {\n            description: '对齐方式（仅图片生效）：\"center\"（默认居中）、\"left\"（居左）、\"right\"（居右）',\n        })),\n        caption: typebox_1.Type.Optional(typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '图片描述/标题（可选，仅图片生效）',\n        })),\n    }),\n    // DOWNLOAD action\n    typebox_1.Type.Object({\n        action: typebox_1.Type.Literal('download'),\n        resource_token: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '资源的唯一标识（file_token 用于文档素材，whiteboard_id 用于画板）',\n        }),\n        resource_type: (0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['media', 'whiteboard'], {\n            description: '资源类型：media（文档素材：图片、视频、文件等）或 whiteboard（画板缩略图）',\n        }),\n        output_path: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '保存文件的完整本地路径。可以包含扩展名（如 /tmp/image.png），' +\n                '也可以不带扩展名，系统会根据 Content-Type 自动添加',\n        }),\n    }),\n]);\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Action handlers\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nasync function handleInsert(p, client, log) {\n    const documentId = extractDocumentId(p.doc_id);\n    const mediaType = p.type ?? 'image';\n    const config = MEDIA_CONFIG[mediaType];\n    // 0. 路径白名单校验 — 仅允许 tmpdir 下的文件\n    const filePath = p.file_path;\n    const DOC_MEDIA_ALLOWED_ROOTS = [os.tmpdir()];\n    (0, media_url_utils_1.validateLocalMediaRoots)(path.resolve(filePath), DOC_MEDIA_ALLOWED_ROOTS);\n    // 1. 读取并校验本地文件\n    let fileSize;\n    try {\n        const stat = await fs.stat(filePath);\n        fileSize = stat.size;\n    }\n    catch (err) {\n        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n            error: `failed to read file: ${err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err)}`,\n        });\n    }\n    if (fileSize > MAX_FILE_SIZE) {\n        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n            error: `file ${(fileSize / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(1)}MB exceeds 20MB limit`,\n        });\n    }\n    const fileName = path.basename(filePath);\n    log.info(`insert: doc=${documentId}, type=${mediaType}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n    // 2. 创建空 Block（追加到文档末尾）\n    const createRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.insert', (sdk, opts) => sdk.docx.documentBlockChildren.create({\n        path: {\n            document_id: documentId,\n            block_id: documentId,\n        },\n        data: {\n\n[172 more lines in file. Use offset=201 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774496788806}}
