{"type":"message","id":"7842c3d8","parentId":"aa838cb3","timestamp":"2026-03-26T05:58:54.945Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-26 13:58:53 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b5378ff051cb0c39a8ce85af8720]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5378ff051cb0c39a8ce85af8720\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-26 13:58 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n我的原始诉求是希望丢一个图片（大概率是孩子的错题），你能准确识别图片中的所有信息（文字和图形），帮我存放到飞书多维表格中，形成一个自动记录的错题本，请你帮我设计一个可以自动化实现的方案。你可以找别人已经有的方案，也可以自己去实现。"}],"timestamp":1774504734938}}
{"type":"message","id":"a2c935a8","parentId":"7842c3d8","timestamp":"2026-03-26T05:59:38.479Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to build an automated error notebook (错题本) system. The flow is:\n1. User sends a photo of a child's错误题 (wrong answer problem)\n2. AI identifies all text and graphics in the image\n3. Saves the info to a Feishu bitable to form an organized error notebook\n\nThis is a really clear and practical use case. Let me think about how to design this:\n\n1. User sends image via Feishu DM\n2. OpenClaw receives the image\n3. AI analyzes the image - recognizes:\n   - Subject/math type\n   - Problem text\n   - Graphical elements (need to preserve as image)\n   - Correct answer\n   - Explanation\n   - Why wrong (error type/root cause)\n4. Creates a record in a bitable with structured fields\n\nThe challenge is that the image needs to be stored as an attachment in the bitable, not just as a URL link.\n\nLet me think about the bitable structure for a 错题本:\n\nFields needed:\n- 科目 (subject) - single select: 数学、语文、英语、物理、化学...\n- 错题图片 (image) - attachment \n- 题目正文 (problem text) - text\n- 正确答案 (correct answer) - text\n- 错误原因 (why wrong) - text\n- 知识点/考点 (knowledge point) - multi-select or text\n- 日期 (date) - date\n- 掌握程度 (mastery level) - rating or single select: 完全掌握、部分掌握、不理解\n\n\n- 复习次数 (review count) - number\n- 下次复习日期 (next review date) - date\n\nFor the image attachment problem - the user could send the image directly in Feishu, and I could:\n1. Use feishu_im_bot_image to download the image from the message\n2. Upload to a proper storage (maybe the bitable's own storage via media API)\n3. Link to the record\n\nWait - but the attachment upload to bitable still requires the `docs:document.media:upload` scope which we're stuck on.\n\nAlternative: Since the image is already in Feishu's CDN when the user sends it, I could store the image URL directly in the bitable using a hyperlink field instead of an attachment field. Alternatively, I could extract the text and problem details from the image and save those as structured data, storing the actual image externally and just linking to it. Let me reconsider the bitable structure for the error notebook. I'd need fields for subject, problem text, correct answer, explanation, error reasons, knowledge points, and an image attachment for the original problem. The core workflow would be: user shares an image of a wrong answer, I analyze and extract the information, then create a record in the bitable with all these fields populated. The image storage remains the tricky part since the attachment API has scope limitations.\n\nLooking at the feishu_doc_media tool, it already uses the `docs:document.media:upload` scope which is what we need. The error message suggests this scope might already be included in what we're requesting, or there's a separate `drive:drive` scope that might be more appropriate for general file access.\n\nLet me reconsider the approach: when a user sends an image through Feishu, it lands on their CDN rather than as a bitable attachment, so I should explore using a hyperlink field to reference it instead. The practical implementation would have the AI extract the question information and store both the text and the image URL in the record.\n\nI need to clarify what scope the bitable upload actually requires—the error mentioned multiple scopes including `docs:doc`, `drive:drive`, and `bitable:app`, with `docs:document.media:upload` being the critical one for uploading media to documents. Let me look into whether the drive API can handle this directly instead.\n\nFor storing images in bitable attachments, the upload needs to go through `drive.v1.media.uploadAll` with specific extra parameters for bitable permissions. I could potentially use the im.getMessages API to retrieve image keys from the user's sent images, then download and re-upload them to bitable. But first, I should explain the overall design approach to the user and then dig into what's actually blocking us with the attachment upload.","thinkingSignature":"be19a5e2dc84d86856d83aa658c4103849c890e9df7fb461b5cfcccb59a9b746"},{"type":"text","text":"这个需求很清晰！让我设计一个完整方案 👇\n\n**整体流程：**\n\n```\n用户发错题图片\n    ↓\nOpenClaw 接收并识别图片内容\n    ↓\nAI 提取：科目、题目、答案、解析、错误原因、知识点\n    ↓\n写入多维表格 + 图片作为附件\n```\n\n**多维表格「错题本」结构建议：**\n\n| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 科目 | 单选 | 数学/语文/英语/物理/化学 |\n| 年级 | 单选 | 初一/初二/初三/高一/高二/高三 |\n| 错题图片 | 附件 | 原题照片 |\n| 题目正文 | 文本 | AI 识别的文字 |\n| 正确答案 | 文本 | 标准答案 |\n| 错误原因 | 文本 | 为什么错 |\n| 知识点 | 多选 | 三角形/函数/几何等 |\n| 掌握程度 | 评级 | ★★★☆☆ |\n| 录入日期 | 日期 | 自动 |\n| 下次复习 | 日期 | 自动推算 |\n\n---\n\n**核心卡点已经找到根因了：**\n\n`feishu_drive_file` 用的是**云盘 API**（`drive.file.uploadAll`），返回 `file_xxx` token。\n\n多维表格附件需要**素材 API**（`drive.media.uploadAll`），返回 `boxcnxxx` token。\n\n我已经在 `doc-media.js` 里加了一个 `bitable_upload` action，但缺少 `docs:document.media:upload` 权限。\n\n**你刚才那个授权卡里包含了8个权限，里面应该有这个 scope——点完授权应该就能跑了。**\n\n你先把那张授权卡点了，我继续帮你实现完整的错题本流程 😎"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":1254,"cacheRead":95720,"cacheWrite":56,"totalTokens":97173,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0015048,"cacheRead":0.0057431999999999995,"cacheWrite":0.000021000000000000002,"total":0.0073119}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774504734954,"responseId":"0613fe2112b2dd6424e9aa934d5963c7"}}
