{"type":"message","id":"4d7327a5","parentId":"794de0ff","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:04:06.766Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\"parent node not exist.\" - the `parent_node` field is empty, but for bitable uploads, the `parent_node` should be the bitable app token, not an empty string. Wait, looking at my code, I set `parent_node: ''` because the `extra` contains the bitablePerm with tableId. But the error says parent node not exist.\n\nLooking at the Feishu API docs more carefully:\n- `parent_type`: bitable_image or bitable_file\n- `parent_node`: for bitable, it should be the bitable app_token (not the table_id!)\n\nLet me fix the code - the `parent_node` for bitable should be the `app_token` (the bitable's token), not empty string. The `extra` field with `bitablePerm` is used to specify which table and field the attachment belongs to.\n\n\nThe API docs confirm this - `parent_node` needs to be the bitable app_token when using `bitable_image` or `bitable_file` parent types, and the permissions are controlled through the `bitablePerm` object in extra. I need to update my implementation to pass the app_token as the parent_node parameter.","thinkingSignature":"108bb3a3faed99ae6f4416986b71f1fb8f87ad019492a88ee1218801851d3aad"},{"type":"text","text":"`parent_node` 不能为空，对于 bitable 应该是 app_token。修复一下：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_x81haq399e22_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js","old_string":"    const parentType = mediaType === 'image' ? 'bitable_image' : 'bitable_file';\n    log.info(`bitable_upload: app=${p.app_token}, table=${p.table_id}, field=${p.field_id}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n    // 上传到 bitable 附件存储，extra 里放 bitablePerm\n    const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.bitable_upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n        data: {\n            file_name: fileName,\n            parent_type: parentType,\n            parent_node: '',\n            size: fileSize,\n            file: (0, node_fs_1.createReadStream)(filePath),\n            extra: JSON.stringify({\n                bitablePerm: {\n                    tableId: p.table_id,\n                },\n            }),\n        },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });","new_string":"    const parentType = mediaType === 'image' ? 'bitable_image' : 'bitable_file';\n    log.info(`bitable_upload: app=${p.app_token}, table=${p.table_id}, field=${p.field_id}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n    // 上传到 bitable 附件存储，parent_node 用 app_token，extra 里放 bitablePerm\n    const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.bitable_upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n        data: {\n            file_name: fileName,\n            parent_type: parentType,\n            parent_node: p.app_token,\n            size: fileSize,\n            file: (0, node_fs_1.createReadStream)(filePath),\n            extra: JSON.stringify({\n                bitablePerm: {\n                    tableId: p.table_id,\n                },\n            }),\n        },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":68623,"output":726,"cacheRead":33389,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102738,"cost":{"input":0.020586899999999998,"output":0.0008711999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0020033399999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.023461439999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774505025282,"responseId":"0613ff4336b3286f7a35fcd98cc3ded3"}}
