{"type":"message","id":"4b4db3de","parentId":"5c484d6e","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:05:19.359Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, but the Feishu API docs say `parent_node` is required. And earlier when I had it empty, I got \"parent node not exist.\" error. Hmm.\n\nLet me re-read the API docs one more time. The docs say:\n- `parent_type`: bitable_image / bitable_file\n- `parent_node`: \"The parent_node is used to specify the specific document or location to which the media will be uploaded.\"\n\nFor bitable specifically, I wonder if `parent_node` should be the `app_token` of the bitable...\n\nActually wait, I think the issue might be different. Looking at the error \"parent node not exist.\" - this comes from the Feishu API itself. \n\nSo the problem is likely that `parent_node` can't be empty, and using the `app_token` doesn't work either. Let me check the material overview documentation to see what the actual constraint is - it says `parent_node` is required for most types except when `extra` is used, so maybe for bitable it's actually the `table_id` or something else entirely that needs to go there.\n\nActually, I should step back and look at the bitable attachment upload flow more carefully. The docs mention two steps: first calling the upload API to get a `file_token`, then passing that token when creating or updating a record. But I'm not sure if the upload step itself already associates the file with the bitable record, or if that's only supposed to happen during the record creation step. Looking at the response structure, I can see that attachments have their own `file_token` field, but I'm still unclear on whether the upload API automatically associates the file with the bitable or if that happens during record creation.\n\nLet me try passing the `app_token` as the `parent_node` for the bitable upload to see if that resolves the \"parent node not exist\" error I'm getting.","thinkingSignature":"f98242206e8d5e0e2d081f5de2dc44faf0cc55cba611192d4c34d37e505035d3"},{"type":"text","text":"等等，API 说 `parent_node` 不能为空。让我换个思路——用飞书官方 API explorer 查一下 bitable_image 到底该怎么传：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dv7k504pa7fn_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"飞书 bitable_image parent_node 上传素材 extra bitablePerm 示例"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":71071,"output":463,"cacheRead":33389,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104923,"cost":{"input":0.021321299999999998,"output":0.0005556,"cacheRead":0.0020033399999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.023880239999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774505098427,"responseId":"0613ff8d2f06af2d0088d90cf0664916"}}
{"type":"message","id":"124e7042","parentId":"4b4db3de","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:05:23.271Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_dv7k504pa7fn_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"飞书 bitable_image parent_node 上传素材 extra bitablePerm 示例\",\n  \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n  \"count\": 2,\n  \"tookMs\": 3871,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fbaf98a903252606\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n素材概述 - 飞书API\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fbaf98a903252606\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feishu.apifox.cn/doc-412743\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b3f9d14bbad158c6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n# 素材概述. 上传素材指将素材（图片/文件）上传到指定云文档中。素材文件在云空间中不会显示，只会显示在对应云文档中。. ## 上传点类型及对应标识符（token）#. ## 上传点类型及对应Scope说明#. | `doc_image` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理文档 请参考应用权限 |. | `doc_file` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理文档 请参考应用权限 |. | `docx_image` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理文档 请参考应用权限 |. | `docx_file` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理文档 请参考应用权限 |. | `sheet_image` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理电子表格 请参考应用权限 |. | `sheet_file` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理电子表格 请参考应用权限 |. | `bitable_image` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理多维表格 请参考应用权限 |. | `bitable_file` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 查看、评论、编辑和管理多维表格 请参考应用权限 |. | `ccm_import_open` | 查看、评论、编辑和管理云文档所有文件 请参考应用权限 |. ## 上传点类型及对应Extra说明#. ### ccm\\\\_import\\\\_open#. 使用导入接口前，需要上传需要导入的文件，对应的parent\\\\_node无需填写，extra填入json序列化后的字符串。. ### bitable\\\\_image/bitable\\\\_file#. type Extra struct { BitablePerm struct { TableId string `json:\\\"tableId\\\"` Attachments map[string]map[string][]string `json:\\\"attachments\\\"` } `json:\\\"bitablePerm\\\"` }. 根据附件所在的字段、记录id和文件token，填写attachments参数；其中attachments第一个key为字段id，第二个key为记录id，value为文件token数组；. {\\\"bitablePerm\\\":{\\\"tableId\\\": \\\"tblO6OeNZxfabcef\\\", \\\"attachments\\\":{\\\"fld32zZi5I\\\":{\\\"rec0BuOHq\\\":[\\\"boxbcsQNT0JsmrztOnX530abcef\\\"]}}}}// 转义后://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/boxbcsQNT0JsmrztOnX530abcef/download? extra=%7B%22bitablePerm%22%3A%7B%22tableId%22%3A%22tblO6OeNZxfabcef%22%2C%22attachments%22%3A%7B%22fld32zZi5I%22%3A%7B%22rec0BuOHq%22%3A%5B%22boxbcsQNT0JsmrztOnX530abcef%22%5D%7D%7D%7D%7D. 用微信扫右侧二维码，加入【飞书】API开发者 交流群，互助沟通. 修改于 2023-01-13 05:54:42.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b3f9d14bbad158c6\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99995637\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"87a8519bacc3268c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n概述- 飞书API\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"87a8519bacc3268c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feishu.apifox.cn/doc-412907\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a6cdb4c1caebefd9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n# 概述. ## 应用场景#. ## 导入文件说明#. 调用导入接口之前先将文件上传以获得 file\\\\_token，参考上传素材(上传接口的 parent\\\\_type 需填写为 ccm\\\\_import\\\\_open，parent\\\\_node 不填)或者上传文件. ## 支持的接口#. ## 创建导入任务参数#. ### **file\\\\_extension**#. 需要导入的文件的后缀类型，必须和 file\\\\_token 的文件的类型相匹配. ### **type**#. 导入后生成的云文档类型，目前支持 doc/docx/sheet/bitable，每种 type 有指定支持的文件类型：. doc(飞书云文档)：支持 Microsoft Word (DOCX)/Microsoft Word 97-2003 (DOC)/md/txt/mark/markdown。当文件扩展类型为 md/txt/mark/markdown 时会将文本内容作为 markdown 解析。. docx(新版飞书云文档)：支持 Microsoft Word (DOCX)/Microsoft Word 97-2003 (DOC)/md/txt/mark/markdown。当文件扩展类型为 md/txt/mark/markdown 时会将文本内容作为 markdown 解析。. sheet(飞书电子表格)：支持 Microsoft Excel (XLSX)/Microsoft Excel 97-2003 (XLS) 与 csv. bitable(飞书多维表格)：支持 Microsoft Excel (XLSX) 与 csv. ## 查询导入任务结果返回#. ### **extra**#. 用微信扫右侧二维码，加入【飞书】API开发者 交流群，互助沟通. 修改于 2023-01-13 06:22:52.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a6cdb4c1caebefd9\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9993068\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"飞书 bitable_image parent_node 上传素材 extra bitablePerm 示例","provider":"ta