{"type":"message","id":"44eb7ca7","parentId":"4326de56","timestamp":"2026-03-26T07:25:09.212Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! I found a GitHub issue about \"Feishu Doc tool support for Docx table + image/file upload workflows\" (#20303). This is about the same problem - uploading images/files to Feishu docs. Let me look at this issue to see if there's a solution.\n\nAlso, the search results mention a third-party plugin `xzq-xu/openclaw-plugin-feishu`. Let me look at this too.\n\nActually, the key finding is the #20303 issue about image/file upload to Feishu docs. Let me check the GitHub issue page.","thinkingSignature":"80ebb1197c965edbc30e004ca3d874835bebfd255be89cb50547af2e8f1cafbd"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_i0299ktlujwl_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/20303","maxChars":8000}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":87515,"output":168,"cacheRead":33389,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":121072,"cost":{"input":0.0262545,"output":0.0002016,"cacheRead":0.0020033399999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02845944}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774509889007,"responseId":"0614124489a277ebd020a3cd6d7398cd"}}
