{"type":"message","id":"bc13f8ba","parentId":"70369458","timestamp":"2026-03-26T08:24:17.892Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_exio4wpk0dlc_1","toolName":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"record\": {\n    \"fields\": {\n      \"文本\": \"测试\"\n    },\n    \"id\": \"recveXzCMxrOkJ\",\n    \"record_id\": \"recveXzCMxrOkJ\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"record":{"fields":{"文本":"测试"},"id":"recveXzCMxrOkJ","record_id":"recveXzCMxrOkJ"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774513457877}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b110626","parentId":"bc13f8ba","timestamp":"2026-03-26T08:24:35.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I created a record with id \"recveXzCMxrOkJ\". Now let me try the bitable_upload with this record's info in the extra field. According to the Feishu docs, the extra for bitable should include tableId and attachments mapping with record_id and field_id.Let me update the code to include the extra with the record mapping and try again.","thinkingSignature":"651252fe82813ffb0412130dad04073f6677d6580b706e2f2457e855ab398a43"},{"type":"text","text":"现在更新代码，加入 `extra` 参数并包含 `tableId` 和 `attachments` 映射：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7imed5ba5ist_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js","old_string":"    const parentType = mediaType === 'image' ? 'bitable_image' : 'bitable_file';\n    // 根据飞书官方示例，parent_node 应为 bitable 的 base_token（bascn开头）\n    // app_token (BeRBb 开头) 不是 drive API 接受的 parent_node\n    // 尝试用 table_id 作为 parent_node（很多案例表明这样可以）\n    log.info(`bitable_upload: app=${p.app_token}, table=${p.table_id}, field=${p.field_id}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n    const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.bitable_upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n        data: {\n            file_name: fileName,\n            parent_type: parentType,\n            parent_node: p.table_id,\n            size: fileSize,\n            file: (0, node_fs_1.createReadStream)(filePath),\n        },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });","new_string":"    const parentType = mediaType === 'image' ? 'bitable_image' : 'bitable_file';\n    // extra 里放入 bitablePerm，包含 tableId 和 attachments 映射（record_id -> [file_token]）\n    // 先用一个占位 record_id，上传成功后会得到 file_token，再更新记录\n    log.info(`bitable_upload: app=${p.app_token}, table=${p.table_id}, field=${p.field_id}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n    const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.bitable_upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n        data: {\n            file_name: fileName,\n            parent_type: parentType,\n            parent_node: p.table_id,\n            size: fileSize,\n            file: (0, node_fs_1.createReadStream)(filePath),\n            extra: JSON.stringify({\n                bitablePerm: {\n                    tableId: p.table_id,\n                },\n            }),\n        },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":89694,"output":602,"cacheRead":33389,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":123685,"cost":{"input":0.0269082,"output":0.0007224,"cacheRead":0.0020033399999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02963394}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774513457895,"responseId":"061420359e772d9197e8d0ac53c75d70"}}
{"type":"message","id":"33536851","parentId":"4b110626","timestamp":"2026-03-26T08:24:36.044Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_7imed5ba5ist_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n 377         });\n 378     }\n 379     const fileName = path.basename(filePath);\n 380     const parentType = mediaType === 'image' ? 'bitable_image' : 'bitable_file';\n-381     // 根据飞书官方示例，parent_node 应为 bitable 的 base_token（bascn开头）\n-382     // app_token (BeRBb 开头) 不是 drive API 接受的 parent_node\n-383     // 尝试用 table_id 作为 parent_node（很多案例表明这样可以）\n+381     // extra 里放入 bitablePerm，包含 tableId 和 attachments 映射（record_id -> [file_token]）\n+382     // 先用一个占位 record_id，上传成功后会得到 file_token，再更新记录\n 384     log.info(`bitable_upload: app=${p.app_token}, table=${p.table_id}, field=${p.field_id}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n 385     const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.bitable_upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n 386         data: {\n 387             file_name: fileName,\n 388             parent_type: parentType,\n 389             parent_node: p.table_id,\n 390             size: fileSize,\n 391             file: (0, node_fs_1.createReadStream)(filePath),\n+391             extra: JSON.stringify({\n+392                 bitablePerm: {\n+393                     tableId: p.table_id,\n+394                 },\n+395             }),\n 392         },\n 393     }, opts), { as: 'user' });\n 394     const fileToken = uploadRes?.file_token ?? uploadRes?.data?.file_token;\n 395     if (!fileToken) {\n     ...","firstChangedLine":381},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774513476037}}
{"type":"message","id":"bc4c7d83","parentId":"33536851","timestamp":"2026-03-26T08:25:00.782Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, I just realized - the `extra` without `attachments` might not be the issue. The \"parent node not exist\" error is about `parent_node`. Let me think about this differently.\n\nLooking at the Feishu material overview again:\n\nFor `bitable_image`, the `parent_node` should be... something. But what?\n\nActually, I think I finally understand the issue! Looking at the \"parent node not exist\" error - this error comes from the Drive service, which manages files. The `parent_node` for bitable_image might need to be a Drive folder token, not a bitable token.\n\nBut here's the thing - the table was created in the Feishu UI, and in Feishu's architecture, ALL files (including bitables) exist in the Drive filesystem. \n\nEvery file in Drive has a token, and for bitables created through the UI, there should be a corresponding Drive entry. When I try using the bitable's app_token as the parent_node, it's rejected because that token doesn't exist in Drive's namespace. The API response suggests the bitable_image parent needs to be a valid Drive node, not just any bitable identifier.\n\nI think the real issue is that bitables created through the API don't automatically get a corresponding Drive node—they're stored in a separate system. But when created through the Feishu UI, a proper Drive node is assigned. So I need to find that node token, possibly through the bitable metadata API or by checking what the user's drive actually contains.\n\nLet me query the drive list using the user's credentials to see what nodes are actually available, then try different approaches like using the folder token or even just an empty string to see if the API accepts that for bitable_image uploads.","thinkingSignature":"05c8de98cda05885c786165015c12946ca9a24cd3bb5825ad34c880ab8f684ec"},{"type":"text","text":"让我试试直接查一下这个 bitable 在