{"type":"message","id":"bf990eeb","parentId":"3494f5c0","timestamp":"2026-03-26T09:38:11.785Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"As expected, this fails too. The file token from the drive (O9ucbvhUko4pojxDcJzcx2tlnKd) doesn't belong to this bitable.\n\nOK let me think about this differently. The fundamental issue is:\n1. `drive.file.uploadAll` → returns `file_xxx` token (works, but wrong format for bitable)\n2. `drive.media.uploadAll` with `parent_type='bitable_image'` → requires valid `parent_node`, which we can't provide\n\nWhat if the issue is that the bitable was created via API and doesn't have a proper \"node\" in the Feishu Drive structure?\n \nMaybe the bitable needs to be shared or moved to a specific folder to be recognized by the media API. But wait—the token itself is the same whether created via API or UI, so that can't be the root cause. The real difference must be something about how the media API validates the parent_node for bitable type uploads. Let me reconsider what the actual constraint is here.\n\nI'm wondering if there's a scope or permission issue preventing the upload. Looking at the scopes available—`bitable:app` for reading and managing, `docs:document.media:upload` for documents—I notice the bitable_image and bitable_file types require `bitable:app` scope. I have that scope, so it shouldn't be blocking me. Let me try using the `file` parameter as a Buffer instead of a stream, since that might be how the SDK expects it.","thinkingSignature":"02f3a260084a2bb3a37d42d56f54ff9aab279c92f5827f1a7e0dbb1e76c5897a"},{"type":"text","text":"还是不行。让我换个最后尝试——直接在 `handleBitableUpload` 里打印一下 SDK 实际发送的请求参数，看问题到底出在哪里。同时试试用 Buffer 代替 stream：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rw2ok40n47pa_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js","old_string":"    const parentType = mediaType === 'image' ? 'bitable_image' : 'bitable_file';\n    log.info(`bitable_upload: app=${p.app_token}, table=${p.table_id}, field=${p.field_id}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n    // 尝试用 folder token 作为 parent_node，看看 bitable_image 是否真的需要 bitable 专用的 parent\n    const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.bitable_upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n        data: {\n            file_name: fileName,\n            parent_type: parentType,\n            parent_node: 'nodcnKUq3QN9lNcCRr9WtG8pjvf',\n            size: fileSize,\n            file: (0, node_fs_1.createReadStream)(filePath),\n            extra: JSON.stringify({\n                bitablePerm: {\n                    tableId: p.table_id,\n                },\n            }),\n        },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });","new_string":"    const parentType = mediaType === 'image' ? 'bitable_image' : 'bitable_file';\n    log.info(`bitable_upload: app=${p.app_token}, table=${p.table_id}, field=${p.field_id}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n    // 读取文件内容作为 Buffer 传递\n    const fileBuffer = await fs.readFile(filePath);\n    const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.bitable_upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n        data: {\n            file_name: fileName,\n            parent_type: parentType,\n            parent_node: p.app_token,\n            size: fileSize,\n            file: fileBuffer,\n            extra: JSON.stringify({\n                bitablePerm: {\n                    tableId: p.table_id,\n                },\n            }),\n        },\n    }, opts), { as: 'user' });"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":81992,"output":825,"cacheRead":33639,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116456,"cost":{"input":0.024597599999999997,"output":0.00099,"cacheRead":0.00201834,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02760594}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774517869309,"responseId":"0614317081f3fffcac6cbd4df0b2d09d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b38e1af8","parentId":"bf990eeb","timestamp":"2026-03-26T09:38:11.829Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_rw2ok40n47pa_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n 378     }\n 379     const fileName = path.basename(filePath);\n 380     const parentType = mediaType === 'image' ? 'bitable_image' : 'bitable_file';\n 381     log.info(`bitable_upload: app=${p.app_token}, table=${p.table_id}, field=${p.field_id}, file=${fileName}, size=${fileSize}`);\n-382     // 尝试用 folder token 作为 parent_node，看看 bitable_image 是否真的需要 bitable 专用的 parent\n+382     // 读取文件内容作为 Buffer 传递\n+383     const fileBuffer = await fs.readFile(filePath);\n 383     const uploadRes = await client.invoke('feishu_doc_media.bitable_upload', (sdk, opts) => sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll({\n 384         data: {\n 385             file_name: fileName,\n 386             parent_type: parentType,\n-387             parent_node: 'nodcnKUq3QN9lNcCRr9WtG8pjvf',\n+388             parent_node: p.app_token,\n 388             size: fileSize,\n-389             file: (0, node_fs_1.createReadStream)(filePath),\n+390             file: fileBuffer,\n 390             extra: JSON.stringify({\n 391                 bitablePerm: {\n 392                     tableId: p.table_id,\n 393                 },\n     ...","firstChangedLine":382},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774517891822}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc537b3c","parentId":"b38e1af8","timestamp":"2026-03-26T09:38:32.209Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, I think the issue might be that the `app_token` itself (UJZtbmw3Hav0zgs0RPzcvcrPnqe) is not a valid `parent_node` for `bitable_image`. Looking at the Drive file list, the bitable's `token` is the same as its `app_token`. But the `parent_node not exist` error suggests the API can't find a Drive node matching that token.\n\nLet me think about what `parent_node` means for `bitable_image`. According to the documentation, `parent_node` is the \"upload point token\". For `bitable_image`, the upload point is the bitable itself. So the `parent_node` should be the bitable's token in Drive.\n \nThe token for the new bitable is `UJZtbmw3Hav0zgs0RPzcvcrPnqe`, but it's showing with an empty name in the Drive file list while the old one displays correctly as \"🍎 苹果虾演示表\". The new bitable was created through the API rather than through the Feishu UI, which might explain why the media upload API isn't recognizing it as a valid upload target.\n\nI'm realizing the core issue: Feishu's `drive.media.uploadAll` with `parent_type='bitable_image'` requires the bitable to exist as an actual Drive entry with a valid node token, and API-created bitables may not have the proper Drive node structure needed for this operation. Rather than continuing to debug the upload flow, I should explore whether I can create the bitable attachment through a different API approach altogether—maybe using the bitable record update API directly instead of trying to upload to a non-existent Drive node.","thinkingSignature":"036ab33ad7d0078d153dde0102003f6171398194114b72566ade53d5f282d60b"},{"type":"text","text":"先这样——把目前所有已知信息整理一下，告诉你当前状态和后续方案：\n\n**已确认的事实：**\n\n1. ✅ 图片可以上传到云盘（`drive.file.uploadAll`）\n2. ✅ 云盘的 file_token 可以获取\n3. ❌ bitable 附件字段不认云盘 token（报错 \"does not belong to this bitable\"）\n4. ❌ `drive.media.uploadAll` + `bitable_image` 上传通道报 \"parent node not exist\"\n\n**问题根因：**\n\n飞书的 `bitable_image` / `bitable_file` 上传通道，需要一个**有效的 Drive node token** 作为 `parent_node`。通过 API 创建的 bitable，虽然有 `app_token`，但它可能在 Drive 里没有有效的 node，或者 node 没有被正确注册到上传通道。\n\n**当前实际可用的方案：**\n\n你之前手动在飞书 UI 里创建的「兮兮的错题本」多维表格是可以工作的。让我用那个表来测试完整流程：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0hv25w82kkwo_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table","arguments":{"action":"list","app_token":"YoHJbARduagO2ls0uvpcG9XNnNg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":82858,"output":619,"cacheRead":33639,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":117116,"cost":{"input":0.024857399999999998,"output":0.0007428,"cacheRead":0.00201834,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.027618539999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774517891832,"responseId":"06143187efc831116e081818b3e9712b"}}
