{"type":"message","id":"c285d6f1","parentId":"df8ef965","timestamp":"2026-03-26T09:45:44.487Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to pause this task. They've been very patient but the bitable attachment upload issue is persistent and complex. Let me acknowledge this and wrap up gracefully.","thinkingSignature":"1ec48750d8a0955b74a5aa0fb419d24dadfed4b50c04d8fa15560e9fa5095e12"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n好的，先暂停！😔\n\n折腾了半天，核心问题是：\n\n- **云盘上传**（`drive.file.uploadAll`）→ ✅ 成功，但返回的 token 多维表格不认\n- **多维表格附件上传**（`drive.media.uploadAll` + `bitable_image`）→ ❌ `parent node not exist` 卡住\n\n这是一个飞书插件的功能缺失——插件没有实现多维表格附件专用上传通道（需要 `drive.media.uploadAll` + 正确的 `parent_node` + `bitablePerm` 组合）。\n\n**等插件作者更新或者有新的解决方案**，或者你也可以去 ClawHub 反馈这个需求。\n\n谢谢你的耐心陪我折腾这么久 😅 有什么其他需要帮忙的随时说！\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":197,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":116451,"totalTokens":116791,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0002364,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.043669125,"total":0.043948425000000006}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774518329286,"responseId":"0614333d465d073c1542a9666e85d520"}}
