{"type":"message","id":"20253401","parentId":"a8532030","timestamp":"2026-03-26T09:47:40.368Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The key insight from the official documentation is clear:\n\n**Upload attachments in a multi-dimensional table in 2 steps:**\n1. Call \"Upload media\" or \"Upload media in blocks\" interface upload file, upload success after obtaining the file file_token\n2. Call \"CreateRecord\" or \"UpdateRecord\" to update files to records\n\nAnd importantly: \"When adding a new record, the file_token for attachment-type fields requires the developer to first upload the attachment to the corresponding [bitable storage]\"\n\nThe critical thing is that `file_token` must come from the `drive.media.uploadAll` API (not `drive.file.uploadAll`). And the `file_token` format for bitable attachments is `boxcn...` (not `file...`).\n \nSo the real issue is that `drive.media.uploadAll` needs a valid `parent_node`, and for bitable specifically, it requires the bitable's node token from the Drive API, not just the app token. The node token is what uniquely identifies the bitable in the system, whereas multiple bitables could share similar app tokens.\n\nThe error \"parent node not exist\" means the node either doesn't exist in Drive or lacks permission, which suggests the app might be missing the `drive:drive` scope needed to access it. I should try the direct API approach using curl with the actual user access token to see what response I get, rather than relying on the SDK wrapper.","thinkingSignature":"cc72891e00f9b35f660199a39424cb6de584415be7730a2cd3c2acada6696ff8"},{"type":"text","text":"找到关键信息了！官方文档说得很清楚：\n\n> **\"Upload attachments... in 2 steps:**\n> 1. Call Upload media (drive.media.uploadAll) \n> 2. Call CreateRecord/UpdateRecord to update files to records\"\n\n**问题是我一直在用 `drive.media.uploadAll`，但 `parent_node` 总报 \"not exist\"。**\n\n让我直接用 curl 测试飞书 API，看官方文档里的 Python 示例到底怎么调通的：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d8fl9x4ub5z4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 找一下飞书插件配置里的 app_id 和 app_secret\nfind /Users/edy/.openclaw -name \"*.json\" -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\" 2>/dev/null | xargs grep -l \"app_id\\|appSecret\" 2>/dev/null | head -5"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":86993,"output":477,"cacheRead":33639,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":121109,"cost":{"input":0.0260979,"output":0.0005723999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00201834,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02868864}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774518438032,"responseId":"061433a98e1ea17f8a3f059bba7c254f"}}
