{"type":"message","id":"1d492c28","parentId":"cd956b87","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:01:15.094Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I've installed this skill. I've saved the SKILL.md file to my workspace, but installing it typically means placing it in a specific directory where OpenClaw can discover and load it as a skill.\n\nLet me check - the skill was saved to `/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/language-learning-tutor/SKILL.md`. But OpenClaw skills are typically loaded from `~/.openclaw/extensions/` or a designated skills directory.\n\nLet me check how skills are loaded in OpenClaw to see if workspace skills are automatically recognized.","thinkingSignature":"423bbc669d325e35ebbe4fd00f5767f9cf22bbb8e32e7c0508ed90c922b7dc5a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_eoup3oybuxnh_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"---\" && cat /Users/edy/.openclaw/openclaw.json | grep -i \"skill\\|extension\" | head -10"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":187,"cacheRead":33639,"cacheWrite":88836,"totalTokens":122805,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00022439999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00201834,"cacheWrite":0.0333135,"total":0.03559914}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774533664152,"responseId":"06146f20787621c04e81a53d81f3764d"}}
