{"type":"message","id":"c50c82b2","parentId":"23db96f2","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:13:40.497Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"两个地方都有 skill 文件：\n1. `/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/language-learning-tutor/` - 这是之前我写的原始版本（中文版本，有完整内容）\n2. `/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/language-learning-tutor/` - 这是后来初始化并打包的版本（英文模板）\n\n问题是两个版本不一样，而且 skill 都没有出现在 `openclaw skills list` 中。让我看看 openclaw 是怎么扫描 skills 的，可能需要重启 gateway 或者有其他配置。\n\n实际上，我记得 AGENTS.md 里说 Skills 在 `~/.openclaw/extensions/` 目录下。让我检查一下是否有 nativeSkills 配置。\n\n实际上看之前 `openclaw skills list` 的输出，它显示的是 `openclaw-extra` 和 `openclaw-bundled` 来源的 skills。\n\n\ngateway 重启后应该会重新扫描这些目录，但 skill 可能需要在配置中注册才能被发现。让我先更新一下这个 skill 的描述，看看是否能解决问题。","thinkingSignature":"4e1d937dbe2a8ee97ba926c483628132c015e7d26147bbf5da5f5167aeab92ba"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jmgfkvriqb15_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /Users/edy/.openclaw/openclaw.json | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(json.dumps(d.get('skills', d.get('extensions', {})), indent=2))\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"no skills key found\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":87136,"output":280,"cacheRead":33639,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":121055,"cost":{"input":0.0261408,"output":0.000336,"cacheRead":0.00201834,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02849514}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774534411569,"responseId":"0614720b1b9756dc9ba8c2c248f6375e"}}
